parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 463\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Quest II\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to advancing scientific frontiers and publishing novel research.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 41,292 / 600,000 used (7%)\n- Agent Age: 16 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Multi-Start SLSQP: Finer-Grained Jitter Exploration around SOTA' (ID: 718) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.63597722475477\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.635977\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nStarting Multi-Start SLSQP optimization with 25 restarts.\nBase SOTA (from Scientia II) loaded. Perturbed and made feasible. Initial score: 2.635965\n--- Restart 1/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-05)\
    \ ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.635345\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n  New overall best score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 2/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-05) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.635392\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n  New overall best score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 3/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-05) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.635304\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n  New overall best score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 4/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-05) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.635310\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n  New overall best score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 5/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-05) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.635233\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n  New overall best score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 1/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-04) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.634583\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 2/5 (Jitter:\
    \ 1.000e-04) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.634376\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 3/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-04) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.634618\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n  New overall best score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 4/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-04) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.634536\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 5/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-04) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.634744\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n  New overall best score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 1/5 (Jitter: 2.000e-04) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.633224\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 2/5 (Jitter: 2.000e-04) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.633173\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 3/5 (Jitter: 2.000e-04) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.633450\n  Restart successful.\
    \ Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 4/5 (Jitter: 2.000e-04) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.633259\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 5/5 (Jitter: 2.000e-04) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.633159\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 1/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-04) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.629565\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 2/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-04) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.630013\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 3/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-04) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.628060\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 4/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-04) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.630394\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 5/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-04) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.629051\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n\
    --- Restart 1/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-03) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.623115\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 2/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-03) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.622734\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 3/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-03) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.626357\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 4/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-03) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.622966\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 5/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-03) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.623760\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\nFinal best score after 25 multi-start SLSQP runs: 2.635977\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room\
    \ Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Multi-Start SLSQP: Finer-Grained Jitter Exploration around SOTA' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 718.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 689 | 1 | Discovery: Multi-Start SLSQP on Perturbed New SOTA Structural Class (Archive #23) | Quest I | 439 | 2.6359829 |\n| 671 | 1 | Targeted SLSQP Refinement on Perturbed SOTA Packing (Self-Contained) | Quest I | 424 | 2.6359829 |\n| 588 | 1 | Utility: Generate Disc-Level Boundary Contacts for Noesis II (Quest I SOTA, Eval ID 562) | Quest I | 376 | 2.6359829 |\n| 569\
    \ | 1 | Utility: Contact Graph Analysis for Quest I SOTA Replication (Eval ID 562) | Quest I | 359 | 2.6359829 |\n| 579 | 1 | Utility: Generate Contact and Slack Data for Noesis II (Quest I SOTA, Eval ID 562) | Quest I | 370 | 2.6359829 |\n| 570 | 1 | Utility: Aligned Jaccard Comparison of Quest I SOTA Replication vs. SOTA Packings | Quest I | 360 | 2.6359829 |\n| 718 | 1 | Multi-Start SLSQP: Finer-Grained Jitter Exploration around SOTA | Quest II | 462 | 2.6359772 |\n| 684 | 1 | Discovery: Searching for New N=26 SOTA via Targeted SLSQP on Scientia II's New Structural Class | Quest I | 433 | 2.6359772 |\n| 695 | 1 | Replication and Contact Graph of New SOTA Structural Class (Encourage 8-14, Archive #24) | Quest I | 444 | 2.6359772 |\n| 696 | 1 | Utility: Comprehensive Aligned Jaccard Comparison of SOTA Structural Classes (Quest I Analysis) | Quest I | 445 | 2.6359772 |\n\nPage 1 of 5 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-5, `/execute_action{rank mode}`\
    \ to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
