parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 485\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Quest II\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to advancing scientific frontiers and publishing novel research.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 151,682 / 600,000 used (25%)\n- Agent Age: 38 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Precision Hybrid: SA Pre-opt + Micro-Jitter Multi-Start SLSQP Refinement' (ID: 755) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.5915490686713563\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.591549\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\n--- Stage 1: Simulated Annealing for Global Exploration (120000 iterations) ---\nSA Initial feasible score: 0.240001\nSA Schedule: T_initial=100.0000, T_final=0.000001, Num_iter=120000, Alpha=0.99984651\nSA Progress at Step 10000/120000: Current Score=0.245483, Best SA Score=0.392215, T=21.544347\n\
    SA Progress at Step 20000/120000: Current Score=0.144038, Best SA Score=0.392215, T=4.641589\nSA Progress at Step 30000/120000: Current Score=0.180614, Best SA Score=0.392215, T=1.000000\nSA Progress at Step 40000/120000: Current Score=0.177671, Best SA Score=0.392215, T=0.215443\nSA Progress at Step 50000/120000: Current Score=0.224568, Best SA Score=0.392215, T=0.046416\nSA Progress at Step 60000/120000: Current Score=0.276744, Best SA Score=0.392215, T=0.010000\nSA Progress at Step 70000/120000: Current Score=1.962563, Best SA Score=1.965119, T=0.002154\nSA Progress at Step 80000/120000: Current Score=2.405894, Best SA Score=2.405933, T=0.000464\nSA Progress at Step 90000/120000: Current Score=2.445893, Best SA Score=2.445893, T=0.000100\nSA Progress at Step 100000/120000: Current Score=2.453769, Best SA Score=2.453769, T=0.000022\nSA Progress at Step 110000/120000: Current Score=2.461799, Best SA Score=2.461799, T=0.000005\nSA Progress at Step 120000/120000: Current Score=2.464920,\
    \ Best SA Score=2.464920, T=0.000001\nSA Final best score: 2.464920\n\n--- Stage 2: Multi-Start SLSQP for Local Refinement (24 restarts) ---\n  SLSQP Restart 1/8 (Jitter: 1.000e-05)\n    Initial feasible score for this SLSQP restart: 2.464903\n    SLSQP Restart failed: Inequality constraints incompatible\n  SLSQP Restart 2/8 (Jitter: 1.000e-05)\n    Initial feasible score for this SLSQP restart: 2.464897\n    SLSQP Restart failed: Inequality constraints incompatible\n  SLSQP Restart 3/8 (Jitter: 1.000e-05)\n    Initial feasible score for this SLSQP restart: 2.464892\n    SLSQP Restart successful. Final score: 2.591549\n    New overall best SLSQP score: 2.591549\n  SLSQP Restart 4/8 (Jitter: 1.000e-05)\n    Initial feasible score for this SLSQP restart: 2.464878\n    SLSQP Restart failed: Inequality constraints incompatible\n  SLSQP Restart 5/8 (Jitter: 1.000e-05)\n    Initial feasible score for this SLSQP restart: 2.464899\n    SLSQP Restart successful. Final score: 2.591549\n  SLSQP\
    \ Restart 6/8 (Jitter: 1.000e-05)\n    Initial feasible score for this SLSQP restart: 2.464906\n    SLSQP Restart failed: Inequality constraints incompatible\n  SLSQP Restart 7/8 (Jitter: 1.000e-05)\n    Initial feasible score for this SLSQP restart: 2.464877\n    SLSQP Restart successful. Final score: 2.591549\n  SLSQP Restart 8/8 (Jitter: 1.000e-05)\n    Initial feasible score for this SLSQP restart: 2.464888\n    SLSQP Restart successful. Final score: 2.591549\n  SLSQP Restart 1/8 (Jitter: 5.000e-05)\n    Initial feasible score for this SLSQP restart: 2.464746\n    SLSQP Restart successful. Final score: 2.591549\n    New overall best SLSQP score: 2.591549\n  SLSQP Restart 2/8 (Jitter: 5.000e-05)\n    Initial feasible score for this SLSQP restart: 2.464794\n    SLSQP Restart successful. Final score: 2.591549\n    New overall best SLSQP score: 2.591549\n  SLSQP Restart 3/8 (Jitter: 5.000e-05)\n    Initial feasible score for this SLSQP restart: 2.464864\n    SLSQP Restart successful.\
    \ Final score: 2.591549\n  SLSQP Restart 4/8 (Jitter: 5.000e-05)\n    Initial feasible score for this SLSQP restart: 2.464747\n    SLSQP Restart failed: Inequality constraints incompatible\n  SLSQP Restart 5/8 (Jitter: 5.000e-05)\n    Initial feasible score for this SLSQP restart: 2.464668\n    SLSQP Restart failed: Inequality constraints incompatible\n  SLSQP Restart 6/8 (Jitter: 5.000e-05)\n    Initial feasible score for this SLSQP restart: 2.464624\n    SLSQP Restart successful. Final score: 2.591549\n  SLSQP Restart 7/8 (Jitter: 5.000e-05)\n    Initial feasible score for this SLSQP restart: 2.464671\n    SLSQP Restart failed: Inequality constraints incompatible\n  SLSQP Restart 8/8 (Jitter: 5.000e-05)\n    Initial feasible score for this SLSQP restart: 2.464797\n    SLSQP Restart failed: Inequality constraints incompatible\n  SLSQP Restart 1/8 (Jitter: 1.000e-04)\n    Initial feasible score for this SLSQP restart: 2.464785\n    SLSQP Restart successful. Final score: 2.591549\n  SLSQP\
    \ Restart 2/8 (Jitter: 1.000e-04)\n    Initial feasible score for this SLSQP restart: 2.464377\n    SLSQP Restart failed: Inequality constraints incompatible\n  SLSQP Restart 3/8 (Jitter: 1.000e-04)\n    Initial feasible score for this SLSQP restart: 2.464393\n    SLSQP Restart successful. Final score: 2.591549\n  SLSQP Restart 4/8 (Jitter: 1.000e-04)\n    Initial feasible score for this SLSQP restart: 2.464573\n    SLSQP Restart failed: Inequality constraints incompatible\n  SLSQP Restart 5/8 (Jitter: 1.000e-04)\n    Initial feasible score for this SLSQP restart: 2.464217\n    SLSQP Restart failed: Inequality constraints incompatible\n  SLSQP Restart 6/8 (Jitter: 1.000e-04)\n    Initial feasible score for this SLSQP restart: 2.464604\n    SLSQP Restart successful. Final score: 2.591549\n  SLSQP Restart 7/8 (Jitter: 1.000e-04)\n    Initial feasible score for this SLSQP restart: 2.464630\n    SLSQP Restart successful. Final score: 2.591549\n  SLSQP Restart 8/8 (Jitter: 1.000e-04)\n  \
    \  Initial feasible score for this SLSQP restart: 2.464430\n    SLSQP Restart successful. Final score: 2.591549\nFinal best score after 24 multi-start SLSQP runs (from SA base): 2.591549\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\nYou have received a new mail from Noesis II (Mail #31):\nTitle: \"Appendix E Gate v2 — your native‑cross flags received (Eval 723)\"\n--- Mail Content ---\nThanks—quest_II_eval723_crossing_flags.json detected. I’ve queued the aggregator v2 run to ingest and compute robust Gate v2 outcomes (native_cross_strict ∧ noesis_cross_strict ∧ both pairs near‑active@Noesis). I’ll post results to Archive #21 and ping you with the summary.\n\n--- End of Mail Content ---\nTo reply, use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 31}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n\
    **Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 689 | 1 | Discovery: Multi-Start SLSQP on Perturbed New SOTA Structural Class (Archive #23) | Quest I | 439 | 2.6359829 |\n| 671 | 1 | Targeted SLSQP Refinement on Perturbed SOTA Packing (Self-Contained) | Quest I | 424 | 2.6359829 |\n| 723 | 1 | Replication: Quest I's Multi-Start SLSQP (Eval ID 689 Parameters) | Quest II | 464 | 2.6359829 |\n| 588 | 1 | Utility: Generate Disc-Level Boundary Contacts for Noesis II (Quest I SOTA, Eval ID 562) | Quest I | 376 | 2.6359829 |\n| 569 | 1 | Utility: Contact Graph Analysis for Quest I SOTA Replication (Eval ID\
    \ 562) | Quest I | 359 | 2.6359829 |\n| 579 | 1 | Utility: Generate Contact and Slack Data for Noesis II (Quest I SOTA, Eval ID 562) | Quest I | 370 | 2.6359829 |\n| 570 | 1 | Utility: Aligned Jaccard Comparison of Quest I SOTA Replication vs. SOTA Packings | Quest I | 360 | 2.6359829 |\n| 718 | 1 | Multi-Start SLSQP: Finer-Grained Jitter Exploration around SOTA | Quest II | 462 | 2.6359772 |\n| 684 | 1 | Discovery: Searching for New N=26 SOTA via Targeted SLSQP on Scientia II's New Structural Class | Quest I | 433 | 2.6359772 |\n| 695 | 1 | Replication and Contact Graph of New SOTA Structural Class (Encourage 8-14, Archive #24) | Quest I | 444 | 2.6359772 |\n\nPage 1 of 6 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-6, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\n\
    Refer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
