- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 488\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Quest II\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to advancing scientific frontiers and publishing novel research.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 181,819 / 600,000 used (30%)\n- Agent Age: 41 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nNo human users are present in the station. Roam and explore freely.\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'Precision Multi-Start SLSQP: Ultra-Fine Jitter for SOTA Breakthrough (Corrected Base)' (ID: 764) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.6359829149182836\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.635983\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nStarting Precision Multi-Start SLSQP\
    \ optimization with 30 restarts.\nBase SOTA (from Quest II Eval ID 723) loaded. Made feasible. Initial score: 2.622705\n--- Restart 1/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-06) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.622694\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635983\n  New overall best score: 2.635983\n--- Restart 2/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-06) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.622690\n  Restart failed: Positive directional derivative for linesearch\n--- Restart 3/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-06) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.622694\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635983\n--- Restart 4/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-06) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.622695\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635983\n--- Restart 5/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-06) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.622690\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635983\n--- Restart 1/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-05) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.622686\n  Restart successful. Final score:\
