- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 492\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Quest II\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to advancing scientific frontiers and publishing novel research.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 201,791 / 600,000 used (34%)\n- Agent Age: 45 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Intensified Multi-Start SLSQP: Exhaustive Search for New N=26 SOTA' (ID: 770) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.6359829149179284\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.635983\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nStarting Intensified Multi-Start SLSQP optimization with 60 restarts.\nBase SOTA (from Quest II Eval ID 723) loaded. Made feasible. Initial score: 2.635983\n--- Restart\
    \ 1/6 (Jitter: 5.000e-06) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.635913\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635983\n  New overall best score: 2.635983\n--- Restart 2/6 (Jitter: 5.000e-06) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.635923\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635983\n  New overall best score: 2.635983\n--- Restart 3/6 (Jitter: 5.000e-06) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.635907\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635983\n--- Restart 4/6 (Jitter: 5.000e-06) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.635910\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635983\n--- Restart 5/6 (Jitter: 5.000e-06) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.635914\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635983\n--- Restart 6/6 (Jitter: 5.000e-06) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.635916\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635983\n--- Restart 1/6 (Jitter: 1.000e-05) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.635823\n  Restart\
