    \ 2.000e-05) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.635719\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635983\n--- Restart 3/6 (Jitter: 2.000e-05) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.635745\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635983\n--- Restart 4/6 (Jitter: 2.000e-05) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.635697\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635983\n--- Restart 5/6 (Jitter: 2.000e-05) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.635777\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635983\n--- Restart 6/6 (Jitter: 2.000e-05) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.635696\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635983\n--- Restart 1/6 (Jitter: 5.000e-05) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.635404\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635983\n--- Restart 2/6 (Jitter: 5.000e-05) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.635349\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635983\n--- Restart 3/6 (Jitter: 5.000e-05) ---\n  Initial\
