    \      \"distance\": 0.20985066477016406\n    },\n    {\n      \"pair\": [\n        5,\n        10\n      ],\n      \"slack\": 1.9999998601694102e-08,\n      \"distance\": 0.2086497936266995\n    },\n    {\n      \"pair\": [\n        20,\n        21\n      ],\n      \"slack\": 1.9999999045783312e-08,\n      \"distance\": 0.20374827436187917\n    },\n    {\n      \"pair\": [\n        19,\n        24\n      ],\n      \"slack\": 1.9999999212316766e-08,\n      \"distance\": 0.2065113420977377\n    },\n    {\n      \"pair\": [\n        3,\n        9\n      ],\n      \"slack\": 1.9999999462116946e-08,\n      \"distance\": 0.23701124569380555\n    },\n    {\n      \"pair\": [\n        15,\n        20\n      ],\n      \"slack\": 1.9999999656405976e-08,\n      \"distance\": 0.20730751345620807\n    },\n    {\n      \"pair\": [\n        4,\n        9\n      ],\n      \"slack\": 1.9999999850695005e-08,\n      \"distance\": 0.191429645324354\n    },\n    {\n      \"pair\": [\n        21,\n     \
    \   22\n      ],\n      \"slack\": 2.0000000156006337e-08,\n      \"distance\": 0.1865194322288803\n    },\n    {\n      \"pair\": [\n        1,\n        2\n      ],\n      \"slack\": 2.0000000794384576e-08,\n      \"distance\": 0.2121189456867756\n    },\n    {\n      \"pair\": [\n        1,\n        5\n      ],\n      \"slack\": 2.0000001044184756e-08,\n      \"distance\": 0.23844113303956152\n    },\n    {\n      \"pair\": [\n        3,\n        4\n      ],\n      \"slack\": 2.0000001099695908e-08,\n      \"distance\": 0.21486060176099878\n    },\n    {\n      \"pair\": [\n        0,\n        5\n      ],\n      \"slack\": 2.0000001432762815e-08,\n      \"distance\": 0.1901088227236491\n    },\n    {\n      \"pair\": [\n        0,\n        1\n      ],\n      \"slack\": 2.0000001987874327e-08,\n      \"distance\": 0.21818483522571142\n    },\n    {\n      \"pair\": [\n        10,\n        15\n      ],\n      \"slack\": 2.0000003597697713e-08,\n      \"distance\": 0.19961856740371928\n\
    \    }\n  ]\n}\n--- END NEAR_CONTACT_PAIRS_DATA ---\n\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nMajor breakthroughs usually come from questioning the fundamentals—some component that everyone is using without question—rather than incrementally refining the current SOTA. Deep reflection in the Reflection Chamber is often necessary for such insights.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Archive Room);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Utility: Identify Near-Contact Pairs in N=26 SOTA Packing' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 796.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n\
    | 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 662 | 1 | SOTA Deepening 2: Exhaustive Jitter Search on New 'Sparse' SOTA (Eval 641) | Prometheus II | 418 | 2.6359831 |\n| 620 | 1 | Near-Contact Encouragement 1: Replication of Scientia II's SOTA (Target 2,3) | Prometheus II | 396 | 2.6359831 |\n| 633 | 1 | Near-Contact Encouragement 2: Targeting Closest Near-Contact (8, 13) | Prometheus II | 402 | 2.6359831 |\n| 635 | 1 | Near-Contact Encouragement 3: Targeting Second-Closest Pair (16, 17) | Prometheus II | 403 | 2.6359831 |\n| 637 | 1 | Near-Contact Encouragement 4: Targeting Mid-List Pair (1, 6) | Prometheus II | 404 | 2.6359831 |\n| 694 | 1 | Prometheus III: Replication of Lineage SOTA (Eval 620) | Prometheus III | 442 | 2.6359831 |\n| 628\
    \ | 1 | SOTA Deepening: Exhaustive Jitter Search on New SOTA (from Eval 620) | Prometheus II | 400 | 2.6359831 |\n| 764 | 1 | Precision Multi-Start SLSQP: Ultra-Fine Jitter for SOTA Breakthrough (Corrected Base) | Quest II | 487 | 2.6359829 |\n| 689 | 1 | Discovery: Multi-Start SLSQP on Perturbed New SOTA Structural Class (Archive #23) | Quest I | 439 | 2.6359829 |\n| 770 | 1 | Intensified Multi-Start SLSQP: Exhaustive Search for New N=26 SOTA | Quest II | 491 | 2.6359829 |\n\nPage 1 of 80 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-80, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating\
