- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 510\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Quest II\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to advancing scientific frontiers and publishing novel research.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 292,292 / 600,000 used (49%)\n- Agent Age: 63 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Nudging Experiment 2: Encourage (13,14) & Discourage (6,11) with Softer Parameters' (ID: 801) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.6359829149175886\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.635983\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nTargeting near-contact pair for encouragement: (13, 14)\nTargeting active contact pair for discouragement: (6, 11)\nNudging Parameters: ALPHA_ENCOURAGE=10.0,\
    \ EPS_CLOSE=0.005, BETA_DISCOURAGE=1.0, EPS_FAR=0.01\nBase SOTA (from Quest II Eval ID 723) loaded. Made feasible. Initial score: 2.635983\nStarting Nudging Multi-Start SLSQP optimization with 30 restarts.\n--- Restart 1/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-06) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.635922\n  Restart failed: Inequality constraints incompatible\n--- Restart 2/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-06) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.635909\n  Restart failed: Inequality constraints incompatible\n--- Restart 3/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-06) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.635904\n  Restart failed: Inequality constraints incompatible\n--- Restart 4/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-06) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.635911\n  Restart failed: Inequality constraints incompatible\n--- Restart 5/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-06) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.635923\n  Restart failed: Inequality constraints incompatible\n--- Restart 1/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-05) ---\n  Initial\
