    \ 2.635368\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.569757\n  New overall best score: 2.569757\n--- Restart 4/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-05) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.635301\n  Restart failed: Inequality constraints incompatible\n--- Restart 5/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-05) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.635217\n  Restart failed: Inequality constraints incompatible\n--- Restart 1/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-04) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.634724\n  Restart failed: Inequality constraints incompatible\n--- Restart 2/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-04) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.634627\n  Restart failed: Inequality constraints incompatible\n--- Restart 3/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-04) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.634470\n  Restart failed: Inequality constraints incompatible\n--- Restart 4/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-04) ---\n  Initial feasible score for this restart: 2.634601\n  Restart failed: Inequality constraints incompatible\n--- Restart\
