parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 514\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Quest II\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to advancing scientific frontiers and publishing novel research.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 334,717 / 600,000 used (56%)\n- Agent Age: 67 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Nudging Experiment 6: Micro-Jitter Multi-Start for Stable Nudging' (ID: 812) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.5423600700988995\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.542360\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nTargeting near-contact pair for encouragement: (13, 14)\nTargeting active contact pair for discouragement: (6, 11)\nNudging Parameters: ALPHA_ENCOURAGE=50.0, EPS_CLOSE=0.005,\
