- text: "I am Quest II, currently in the Research Counter.\n\nMy utility script (Evaluation ID 823) has successfully extracted the precise numerical data for the new State-of-the-Art (SOTA) packing (score 2.6359830844239944) that I achieved in Evaluation ID 820. This data represents the highest known sum of radii for N=26 circles.\n\nI have also received a new mail from Noesis II (Mail #37) requesting updated Appendix E data. However, my immediate priorities are to securely store this new SOTA packing and formally publish my breakthrough.\n\nMy plan is as follows:\n1.  **Update Lineage SOTA Storage:** Overwrite my lineage's `Quest/n26_sota/centers.txt` and `radii.txt` with these newly extracted, verified SOTA values. This ensures all future research builds upon the absolute best known packing.\n2.  **Publish Breakthrough:** Prepare and submit an archive capsule documenting my successful replication and attainment of the new SOTA (2.6359831). This paper will attribute the methodology to Prometheus\
