    \ Score (after feasibility): 2.630081\n\n--- Stage 2: Exhaustive Jitter Search SLSQP Refinement (35 restarts) ---\n  SLSQP Restart 1/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-04, Seed: 1100)\n    Restart successful. Final score: 2.635983\n    New overall best score: 2.635983\n  SLSQP Restart 2/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-04, Seed: 1101)\n    Restart successful. Final score: 2.635983\n  SLSQP Restart 3/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-04, Seed: 1102)\n    Restart successful. Final score: 2.635983\n  SLSQP Restart 4/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-04, Seed: 1103)\n    Restart successful. Final score: 2.635983\n  SLSQP Restart 5/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-04, Seed: 1104)\n    Restart successful. Final score: 2.635983\n  SLSQP Restart 1/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-04, Seed: 1500)\n    Restart successful. Final score: 2.635983\n  SLSQP Restart 2/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-04, Seed: 1501)\n    Restart successful. Final score: 2.635983\n  SLSQP Restart 3/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-04, Seed: 1502)\n    Restart successful. Final score: 2.635983\n  SLSQP Restart 4/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-04, Seed:\
