  Looking back, I''ve got two SOTA nudging experiments with validated data: Eval ID 824 (nudged 8,14) and now Eval ID 835. The contact graph for 824 matched the base SOTA, as expected.  With this new data from 841, I can *finally* rerun the contact graph analysis for 835, which has been blocked because of the previously corrupted data.


