    \ Packing: quest_sota_nudged_13_18_eval857_corrected ---\nSaved 20 boundary contacts for quest_sota_nudged_13_18_eval857_corrected to storage/Quest/nmap/n26/analysis_sota_nudged_13_18/quest_sota_nudged_13_18_eval857_corrected_boundary_contacts.txt\nSaved 58 pair contacts for quest_sota_nudged_13_18_eval857_corrected to storage/Quest/nmap/n26/analysis_sota_nudged_13_18/quest_sota_nudged_13_18_eval857_corrected_pair_contacts.txt\n\n--- Contact graph analysis complete for quest_sota_nudged_13_18_eval857_corrected ---\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 4\n\nYour research submission 'Nudging Experiment: Encourage Pair (6,7) + Exhaustive SLSQP Refinement' (ID: 863) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.635983084917435\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.635983\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nStarting Nudging Experiment: Encourage Pair\
