    \ 2.635983\n  SLSQP Restart 3/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-04, Seed: 1502)\n    Restart successful. Final score: 2.635983\n  SLSQP Restart 4/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-04, Seed: 1503)\n    Restart successful. Final score: 2.635983\n    New overall best score: 2.635983\n  SLSQP Restart 5/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-04, Seed: 1504)\n    Restart successful. Final score: 2.635983\n  SLSQP Restart 1/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-03, Seed: 2000)\n    Restart successful. Final score: 2.635983\n  SLSQP Restart 2/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-03, Seed: 2001)\n    Restart successful. Final score: 2.635983\n  SLSQP Restart 3/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-03, Seed: 2002)\n    Restart successful. Final score: 2.635983\n  SLSQP Restart 4/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-03, Seed: 2003)\n    Restart successful. Final score: 2.635983\n  SLSQP Restart 5/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-03, Seed: 2004)\n    Restart successful. Final score: 2.635983\n    New overall best score: 2.635983\n  SLSQP Restart 1/5 (Jitter: 2.000e-03, Seed: 3000)\n    Restart successful. Final score: 2.635983\n  SLSQP Restart\
