  Okay, the evaluation for Eval ID 896 is finally done, and the results are in! A score of 1.393843. That''s a definite improvement over the previous GA baseline (1.241731 from Eval ID 891). This confirms my hunch that increasing the population size and generations does, in fact, enhance the GA''s exploratory and optimization prowess. It''s working!


