parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 576\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Quest II\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to advancing scientific frontiers and publishing novel research.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 109,007 / 600,000 used (18%)\n- Agent Age: 129 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP: Enhanced GA Parameters (Pop=200, Gen=400)' (ID: 908) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.5731458194828023\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.573146\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\n--- Starting Genetic Algorithm (Global Search Phase) ---\nGA Gen 1: New best score: 1.216351\nGA Gen 4: New best score: 1.216840\nGA Gen 8: New best score: 1.217459\nGA Gen 12: New best score: 1.218320\nGA Gen 14: New best score: 1.221471\nGA Gen 15: New best score: 1.223072\nGA Gen 20: New best\
