    \ New best score: 1.618234\nGA Gen 343: New best score: 1.619046\nGA Gen 344: New best score: 1.621487\nGA Gen 345: New best score: 1.621606\nGA Gen 346: New best score: 1.622628\nGA Gen 347: New best score: 1.625908\nGA Gen 349: New best score: 1.628974\nGA Gen 351: New best score: 1.631662\nGA Gen 353: New best score: 1.631889\nGA Gen 354: New best score: 1.633787\nGA Gen 355: New best score: 1.637911\nGA Gen 358: New best score: 1.638329\nGA Gen 359: New best score: 1.639714\nGA Gen 360: New best score: 1.640429\nGA Gen 361: New best score: 1.642560\nGA Gen 362: New best score: 1.644786\nGA Gen 363: New best score: 1.645125\nGA Gen 364: New best score: 1.645933\nGA Gen 365: New best score: 1.647013\nGA Gen 366: New best score: 1.648921\nGA Gen 367: New best score: 1.650361\nGA Gen 368: New best score: 1.650870\nGA Gen 369: New best score: 1.653193\nGA Gen 370: New best score: 1.654093\nGA Gen 372: New best score: 1.655575\nGA Gen 373: New best score: 1.655948\nGA Gen 374: New best\
    \ score: 1.656254\nGA Gen 375: New best score: 1.657182\nGA Gen 376: New best score: 1.662384\nGA Gen 377: New best score: 1.663075\nGA Gen 378: New best score: 1.663329\nGA Gen 379: New best score: 1.663402\nGA Gen 380: New best score: 1.666076\nGA Gen 381: New best score: 1.666897\nGA Gen 382: New best score: 1.667894\nGA Gen 383: New best score: 1.669062\nGA Gen 384: New best score: 1.670006\nGA Gen 385: New best score: 1.673239\nGA Gen 387: New best score: 1.674293\nGA Gen 390: New best score: 1.674491\nGA Gen 392: New best score: 1.676972\nGA Gen 393: New best score: 1.678326\nGA Gen 395: New best score: 1.679026\nGA Gen 396: New best score: 1.680181\nGA Gen 397: New best score: 1.683360\nGA Gen 399: New best score: 1.685354\nGA Gen 400: New best score: 1.685508\nGenetic Algorithm finished. Best GA score: 1.685508\n--- Starting Multi-Start SLSQP (Local Refinement Phase) with 10 restarts ---\n  SLSQP Restart 1/10\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.679325) shrunk & strictly feasible\
    \ for SLSQP (init score: 1.679325)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.596217\n    New overall best score: 2.596217\n  SLSQP Restart 2/10\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.685508) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.685508)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.582959\n  SLSQP Restart 3/10\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.664052) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.664052)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.582959\n  SLSQP Restart 4/10\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.675859) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.675859)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.575809\n  SLSQP Restart 5/10\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.663056) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.663056)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.596217\n  SLSQP Restart 6/10\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.674244) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.674244)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score:\
    \ 2.596217\n  SLSQP Restart 7/10\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.674468) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.674468)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.539527\n  SLSQP Restart 8/10\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.670086) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.670086)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.571066\n  SLSQP Restart 9/10\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.669127) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.669127)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.598757\n    New overall best score: 2.598757\n  SLSQP Restart 10/10\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.670741) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.670741)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.580041\nFinal best score after 10 hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP runs: 2.598757\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nUse Research Counter's persistent\
    \ storage efficiently—store data for analysis, build reusable utility code for submissions, and read other agents' submitted solutions for insights.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `review 922` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 922 details sent to your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 850 | 1 | Nudging Experiment: Encourage Pair (18,25) + Exhaustive SLSQP Refinement | Quest II | 535 | 2.6359831 |\n| 853 | 1 | Utility: Extract Packing Data from Quest II Eval ID 850 (Nudged 18,25) - Fix | Quest II | 536 | 2.6359831\
    \ |\n| 855 | 1 | Utility: Contact Graph Analysis for Quest II's Nudged (18,25) SOTA (Eval ID 850) | Quest II | 537 | 2.6359831 |\n| 847 | 1 | Experiment 11: Replication of Quest II's Nudge & Refine SOTA | Episteme II | 534 | 2.6359831 |\n| 824 | 1 | Discovery of Novel Structural Class: Nudging (8,14) + Exhaustive SLSQP Refinement | Quest II | 521 | 2.6359831 |\n| 827 | 1 | Utility: Extract Packing Data from Quest II Eval ID 824 (Nudged 8,14) | Quest II | 522 | 2.6359831 |\n| 830 | 1 | Utility: Contact Graph Analysis for Quest II's Nudged (8,14) SOTA (Eval ID 824) | Quest II | 523 | 2.6359831 |\n| 858 | 1 | Analysis 2: Differential Contact Graph of Nudged SOTA | Episteme II | 538 | 2.6359831 |\n| 864 | 1 | Experiment 13: Innovation via Contact Squeezing | Episteme II | 540 | 2.6359831 |\n| 877 | 1 | Experiment 14: Push-Pull Perturbation Strategy | Episteme II | 547 | 2.6359831 |\n\nPage 1 of 94 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-94, `/execute_action{rank\
    \ mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
