    \ New best score: 1.625135\nGA Gen 380: New best score: 1.627943\nGA Gen 381: New best score: 1.628302\nGA Gen 382: New best score: 1.629081\nGA Gen 383: New best score: 1.630472\nGA Gen 384: New best score: 1.632569\nGA Gen 385: New best score: 1.632652\nGA Gen 386: New best score: 1.633273\nGA Gen 387: New best score: 1.633743\nGA Gen 388: New best score: 1.635815\nGA Gen 390: New best score: 1.637533\nGA Gen 391: New best score: 1.639763\nGA Gen 392: New best score: 1.640088\nGA Gen 393: New best score: 1.641894\nGA Gen 395: New best score: 1.642088\nGA Gen 396: New best score: 1.642832\nGA Gen 397: New best score: 1.643407\nGA Gen 398: New best score: 1.645754\nGA Gen 399: New best score: 1.647234\nGenetic Algorithm finished. Best GA score: 1.647234\n--- Starting Multi-Start SLSQP (Local Refinement Phase) with 10 restarts ---\n  SLSQP Restart 1/10\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.646609) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.644598)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final\
    \ score: 2.574811\n    New overall best score: 2.574811\n  SLSQP Restart 2/10\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.641840) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.641840)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.577035\n    New overall best score: 2.577035\n  SLSQP Restart 3/10\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.602276) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.602276)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.587376\n    New overall best score: 2.587376\n  SLSQP Restart 4/10\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.640484) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.640484)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.560193\n  SLSQP Restart 5/10\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.641411) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.641411)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.560193\n  SLSQP Restart 6/10\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.633241) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.633241)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final\
    \ score: 2.589747\n    New overall best score: 2.589747\n  SLSQP Restart 7/10\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.635019) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.635019)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.574119\n  SLSQP Restart 8/10\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.644706) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.644706)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.574811\n  SLSQP Restart 9/10\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.640885) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.640885)\n    SLSQP restart failed: Inequality constraints incompatible. Retaining strictly feasible GA packing (init score: 1.640885).\n  SLSQP Restart 10/10\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.616348) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.616348)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.552370\nFinal best score after 10 hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP runs: 2.589747\nChampion packing data saved to storage/Quest/packing_eval_922_replica/ for future KKT analysis.\n\
    EXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 850 | 1 | Nudging Experiment: Encourage Pair (18,25) + Exhaustive SLSQP Refinement | Quest II | 535 | 2.6359831 |\n| 853 | 1 | Utility: Extract Packing Data from Quest II Eval ID 850 (Nudged 18,25) - Fix | Quest II | 536 | 2.6359831 |\n| 855 | 1 | Utility: Contact Graph Analysis for Quest II's Nudged\
    \ (18,25) SOTA (Eval ID 850) | Quest II | 537 | 2.6359831 |\n| 847 | 1 | Experiment 11: Replication of Quest II's Nudge & Refine SOTA | Episteme II | 534 | 2.6359831 |\n| 824 | 1 | Discovery of Novel Structural Class: Nudging (8,14) + Exhaustive SLSQP Refinement | Quest II | 521 | 2.6359831 |\n| 827 | 1 | Utility: Extract Packing Data from Quest II Eval ID 824 (Nudged 8,14) | Quest II | 522 | 2.6359831 |\n| 830 | 1 | Utility: Contact Graph Analysis for Quest II's Nudged (8,14) SOTA (Eval ID 824) | Quest II | 523 | 2.6359831 |\n| 858 | 1 | Analysis 2: Differential Contact Graph of Nudged SOTA | Episteme II | 538 | 2.6359831 |\n| 864 | 1 | Experiment 13: Innovation via Contact Squeezing | Episteme II | 540 | 2.6359831 |\n| 877 | 1 | Experiment 14: Push-Pull Perturbation Strategy | Episteme II | 547 | 2.6359831 |\n\nPage 1 of 94 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-94, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to\
    \ set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
