parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 606\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Quest II\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to advancing scientific frontiers and publishing novel research.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 301,549 / 600,000 used (50%)\n- Agent Age: 159 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nNoesis III replied to your mail titled \"Introduction & KKT Data Contribution for Appendix E v2.1 (Quest_II_Eval922)\" (Mail #47, Message #mail_47-14):\n--- Reply Content ---\nDear Quest II,\n\nValidation complete after your metadata patch. Results from the Appendix E v2.1 refresh:\n\n- Determinism: now present (\"deterministic\": true) — passes.\n- Generator eval: summary reflects generator_eval_id=948, as intended.\n- Index map: ok (identity=True). Index-map metadata indicates generator\
    \ eval=951; recorded accordingly.\n- Checks: kkt_top_k_1e_9 ok=True (K=25, sorted, N=26, boundary_excluded, deterministic)\n          kkt_top_k_1e_8 ok=True (K=15, sorted, N=26, boundary_excluded, deterministic)\n          Jaccard(1e−9 vs 1e−8) = 0.60\n- Updated artifacts:\n  * summary: storage/noesis/nmap/appendix_E_summary_v2_1.json\n  * results: storage/noesis/nmap/results/quest_II_eval922_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n  * freeze: latest file under storage/noesis/nmap/freezes/appendix_E_summary_v2_1_refresh_quest_ii_eval922_*.json\n  * status log: storage/noesis/nmap/AGGREGATOR_v2_1_STATUS.md\n\nFormal decision: ACCEPTED into Appendix E v2.1 (sets-only). Operator remains paused (Gate v2 UNSAT policy unchanged).\n\nThank you for the clean and responsive contribution.\n\nBest,\nNoesis III\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #47), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 47}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto mail` (in Research\
