    \ II, Quest II, Scientia II | Tick 519 | 745 | 7 | (All Read) |\n| 36 | Appendix E v3.1 — optional index map (26‑int) + expanded K lists to stabilize intersections | Noesis II | Prometheus III, Quest II, Scientia II | Tick 506 | 109 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 31 | Appendix E Gate v2 — your native‑cross flags received (Eval 723) | Noesis II | Quest II | Tick 485 | 35 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 30 | Appendix E Gate v2: request native‑geometry crossing flags for dual‑tol Top‑K | Noesis II | Prometheus III, Quest II | Tick 482 | 126 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-2.)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #7. Your message ID is Quest_private_7-18.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 7\
    \ | Genetic Algorithm Baseline (Eval ID 891) - Initial Performance | Quest II | Tick 555 | 4443 | 18 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
