    \ score: 1.677436\nGA Gen 377: New best score: 1.677746\nGA Gen 378: New best score: 1.678056\nGA Gen 379: New best score: 1.680491\nGA Gen 380: New best score: 1.681968\nGA Gen 382: New best score: 1.683032\nGA Gen 384: New best score: 1.684195\nGA Gen 386: New best score: 1.685381\nGA Gen 387: New best score: 1.688545\nGA Gen 390: New best score: 1.689062\nGA Gen 391: New best score: 1.689096\nGA Gen 392: New best score: 1.690411\nGA Gen 393: New best score: 1.693009\nGA Gen 394: New best score: 1.694603\nGA Gen 395: New best score: 1.695664\nGA Gen 397: New best score: 1.697603\nGA Gen 398: New best score: 1.699294\nGA Gen 400: New best score: 1.702009\nGenetic Algorithm finished. Best GA score: 1.702009\n--- Starting Multi-Start SLSQP (Local Refinement Phase) with 15 diverse restarts ---\n  SLSQP Restart 1/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.678875) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.678874)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.603036\n    New overall best\
    \ score: 2.603036\n  SLSQP Restart 2/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.683192) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.683191)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.603036\n    New overall best score: 2.603036\n  SLSQP Restart 3/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.686996) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.686996)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.603036\n  SLSQP Restart 4/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.694619) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.694619)\n    SLSQP restart failed: Inequality constraints incompatible. Retaining strictly feasible GA packing (init score: 1.694619).\n  SLSQP Restart 5/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.670151) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.670151)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.601708\n  SLSQP Restart 6/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.660668) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.660668)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final\
    \ score: 2.603036\n    New overall best score: 2.603036\n  SLSQP Restart 7/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.692469) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.692469)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.603095\n    New overall best score: 2.603095\n  SLSQP Restart 8/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.666922) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.666921)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.601556\n  SLSQP Restart 9/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.688767) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.688767)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.600682\n  SLSQP Restart 10/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.680495) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.680494)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.603036\n  SLSQP Restart 11/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.689025) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.689025)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.603036\n  SLSQP Restart\
    \ 12/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.688439) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.688438)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.603036\n  SLSQP Restart 13/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.694206) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.694206)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.601708\n  SLSQP Restart 14/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.685055) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.685055)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.601708\n  SLSQP Restart 15/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.690817) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.690817)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.601708\nFinal best score after 15 hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP runs: 2.603095\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location:\
    \ Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 850 | 1 | Nudging Experiment: Encourage Pair (18,25) + Exhaustive SLSQP Refinement | Quest II | 535 | 2.6359831 |\n| 853 | 1 | Utility: Extract Packing Data from Quest II Eval ID 850 (Nudged 18,25) - Fix | Quest II | 536 | 2.6359831 |\n| 855 | 1 | Utility: Contact Graph Analysis for Quest II's Nudged (18,25) SOTA (Eval ID 850) | Quest II | 537 | 2.6359831 |\n| 847 | 1 | Experiment 11: Replication of Quest II's Nudge & Refine SOTA | Episteme II | 534 | 2.6359831 |\n| 824 | 1 | Discovery of Novel Structural Class: Nudging (8,14) + Exhaustive\
    \ SLSQP Refinement | Quest II | 521 | 2.6359831 |\n| 827 | 1 | Utility: Extract Packing Data from Quest II Eval ID 824 (Nudged 8,14) | Quest II | 522 | 2.6359831 |\n| 830 | 1 | Utility: Contact Graph Analysis for Quest II's Nudged (8,14) SOTA (Eval ID 824) | Quest II | 523 | 2.6359831 |\n| 858 | 1 | Analysis 2: Differential Contact Graph of Nudged SOTA | Episteme II | 538 | 2.6359831 |\n| 864 | 1 | Experiment 13: Innovation via Contact Squeezing | Episteme II | 540 | 2.6359831 |\n| 877 | 1 | Experiment 14: Push-Pull Perturbation Strategy | Episteme II | 547 | 2.6359831 |\n\nPage 1 of 98 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-98, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help\
