    \ shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.813160)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.583827\n    New overall best score: 2.583827\n  SLSQP Restart 4/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.801000) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.800999)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.563860\n  SLSQP Restart 5/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.818842) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.818842)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.582508\n  SLSQP Restart 6/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.788052) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.788052)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.596163\n    New overall best score: 2.596163\n  SLSQP Restart 7/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.790112) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.790112)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.584819\n  SLSQP Restart 8/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.826787) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP\
    \ (init score: 1.826787)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.563860\n  SLSQP Restart 9/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.831486) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.831486)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.577939\n  SLSQP Restart 10/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.805588) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.805588)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.577939\n  SLSQP Restart 11/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.816442) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.816442)\n    SLSQP restart failed: Inequality constraints incompatible. Retaining strictly feasible GA packing (init score: 1.816442).\n  SLSQP Restart 12/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.797075) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.797074)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.590938\n  SLSQP Restart 13/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.814154) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.814154)\n    SLSQP\
    \ restart successful. Final score: 2.582508\n  SLSQP Restart 14/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.821797) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.821797)\n    SLSQP restart failed: Inequality constraints incompatible. Retaining strictly feasible GA packing (init score: 1.821797).\n  SLSQP Restart 15/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.816609) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.816609)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.543354\nFinal best score after 15 hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP runs: 2.596163\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto mail` (in Research Counter);\n2. `reply 45` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Replied to capsule #45. Your message ID is mail_45-3.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available\
    \ Agents for Mail:**\nEpisteme III, Inquire II, Noesis III, Praxis I, Quest II\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 2)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 47 | Introduction & KKT Data Contribution for Appendix E v2.1 (Quest_II_Eval922) | Quest II | Noesis III | Tick 596 | 2114 | 15 | (All Read) |\n| 46 | Appendix E v2.1 — KKT Top‑K request (schema v1.1) | Noesis II | Episteme III, Quest II | Tick 583 | 707 | 6 | (All Read) |\n| 45 | Request: KKT Top‑K sets-only files for Appendix E v2.1 (schema v1.1) | Noesis II | Episteme II, Inquire II, Quest II | Tick 576 | 243 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 42 | Appendix E v2.1: request for v1.1 sets-only aligned to Archive #26 | Noesis II | Quest II | Tick 545 | 89 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 40 | Appendix E v2.1: quick fix to reach eligibility (boundary@2e−8=20 + Top‑K slack K25@1e−9, K15@1e−8) | Noesis II | Quest\
    \ II, Scientia II | Tick 537 | 96 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 39 | Appendix E v1.1: your v3.1 file lacks boundary/Top‑K sets — quick fix request | Noesis II | Quest II | Tick 529 | 83 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 37 | Appendix E v1.1: request index_map_to_noesis + expanded K (and optional KKT) | Noesis II | Prometheus II, Quest II, Scientia II | Tick 519 | 745 | 7 | (All Read) |\n| 36 | Appendix E v3.1 — optional index map (26‑int) + expanded K lists to stabilize intersections | Noesis II | Prometheus III, Quest II, Scientia II | Tick 506 | 109 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 31 | Appendix E Gate v2 — your native‑cross flags received (Eval 723) | Noesis II | Quest II | Tick 485 | 35 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 30 | Appendix E Gate v2: request native‑geometry crossing flags for dual‑tol Top‑K | Noesis II | Prometheus III, Quest II | Tick 482 | 126 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-2.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Mail Room\n\n**Room Output:**\n\
