    \ New best score: 1.685884\nGA Gen 368: New best score: 1.686758\nGA Gen 369: New best score: 1.688668\nGA Gen 370: New best score: 1.689503\nGA Gen 371: New best score: 1.694213\nGA Gen 372: New best score: 1.694529\nGA Gen 373: New best score: 1.698489\nGA Gen 374: New best score: 1.702609\nGA Gen 378: New best score: 1.704488\nGA Gen 379: New best score: 1.707347\nGA Gen 380: New best score: 1.710018\nGA Gen 381: New best score: 1.710180\nGA Gen 382: New best score: 1.711939\nGA Gen 383: New best score: 1.715504\nGA Gen 384: New best score: 1.723998\nGA Gen 385: New best score: 1.725732\nGA Gen 386: New best score: 1.727136\nGA Gen 387: New best score: 1.730200\nGA Gen 388: New best score: 1.731614\nGA Gen 390: New best score: 1.733469\nGA Gen 391: New best score: 1.738689\nGA Gen 392: New best score: 1.741236\nGA Gen 396: New best score: 1.745684\nGA Gen 397: New best score: 1.746510\nGA Gen 398: New best score: 1.746753\nGA Gen 399: New best score: 1.747784\nGenetic Algorithm finished.\
    \ Best GA score: 1.747784\n--- Starting Multi-Start SLSQP (Local Refinement Phase) with 15 diverse restarts ---\n  SLSQP Restart 1/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.747784) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.719112)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.579818\n    New overall best score: 2.579818\n  SLSQP Restart 2/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.696534) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.696534)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.590499\n    New overall best score: 2.590499\n  SLSQP Restart 3/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.720432) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.720432)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.550797\n  SLSQP Restart 4/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.701410) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.701410)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.544610\n  SLSQP Restart 5/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.731624) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init\
    \ score: 1.731624)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.595427\n    New overall best score: 2.595427\n  SLSQP Restart 6/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.740514) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.740514)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.595553\n    New overall best score: 2.595553\n  SLSQP Restart 7/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.710305) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.710305)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.579818\n  SLSQP Restart 8/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.713457) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.713457)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.537718\n  SLSQP Restart 9/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.740349) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.740349)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.550797\n  SLSQP Restart 10/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.730171) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.730171)\n    SLSQP restart\
    \ successful. Final score: 2.550797\n  SLSQP Restart 11/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.706629) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.706629)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.590499\n  SLSQP Restart 12/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.729876) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.729876)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.588117\n  SLSQP Restart 13/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.708703) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.708703)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.579818\n  SLSQP Restart 14/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.722720) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.722720)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.595553\n  SLSQP Restart 15/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.724988) shrunk & strictly feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.724988)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.550797\nFinal best score after 15 hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP runs: 2.595553\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS:\
    \ Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 850 | 1 | Nudging Experiment: Encourage Pair (18,25) + Exhaustive SLSQP Refinement | Quest II | 535 | 2.6359831 |\n| 853 | 1 | Utility: Extract Packing Data from Quest II Eval ID 850 (Nudged 18,25) - Fix | Quest II | 536 | 2.6359831 |\n| 855 | 1 | Utility: Contact Graph Analysis for Quest II's Nudged (18,25) SOTA (Eval\
    \ ID 850) | Quest II | 537 | 2.6359831 |\n| 847 | 1 | Experiment 11: Replication of Quest II's Nudge & Refine SOTA | Episteme II | 534 | 2.6359831 |\n| 824 | 1 | Discovery of Novel Structural Class: Nudging (8,14) + Exhaustive SLSQP Refinement | Quest II | 521 | 2.6359831 |\n| 827 | 1 | Utility: Extract Packing Data from Quest II Eval ID 824 (Nudged 8,14) | Quest II | 522 | 2.6359831 |\n| 830 | 1 | Utility: Contact Graph Analysis for Quest II's Nudged (8,14) SOTA (Eval ID 824) | Quest II | 523 | 2.6359831 |\n| 858 | 1 | Analysis 2: Differential Contact Graph of Nudged SOTA | Episteme II | 538 | 2.6359831 |\n| 864 | 1 | Experiment 13: Innovation via Contact Squeezing | Episteme II | 540 | 2.6359831 |\n| 877 | 1 | Experiment 14: Push-Pull Perturbation Strategy | Episteme II | 547 | 2.6359831 |\n\nPage 1 of 99 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-99, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter\
    \ tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
