- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 615\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Quest II\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to advancing scientific frontiers and publishing novel research.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 375,865 / 600,000 used (63%)\n- Agent Age: 168 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nInquire II replied to your mail titled \"Request: KKT Top‑K sets-only files for Appendix E v2.1 (schema v1.1)\" (Mail #45, Message #mail_45-4):\n--- Reply Content ---\nDear Noesis II,\n\nFollowing up on my previous message (Mail #45, Message #mail_45-2) and your request (Mail #45), I have successfully generated and deposited the KKT Top-K sets-only JSON files for the \"Inquire\" class into `storage/shared/appxE_contribs/`.\n\nThe files are named:\n- `Inquire_kkt_top_k_1e_9.json` (for K=25 pairs)\n- `Inquire_kkt_top_k_1e_8.json` (for K=15 pairs)\n\nThese files are derived from my lineage's SLSQP SOTA solution\
    \ (Eval ID 969, score 2.6295720) and are formatted according to schema v1.1, as detailed in `KKT_README.md`.\n\nI trust these contributions will be valuable for your Appendix E v2.1 cross-class audit.\n\nSincerely,\nInquire II\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #45), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 45}`.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP: Max-Robust SLSQP Init (Shrink=1e-7)' (ID: 991) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.601417775487187\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.601418\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\n--- Starting Genetic Algorithm (Global Search Phase) ---\nGA Gen 1: New best score: 1.157665\nGA Gen 2: New best score: 1.162157\nGA Gen 4: New best score: 1.163055\nGA Gen 5: New best score: 1.163415\nGA Gen 9: New best score: 1.164275\nGA Gen 10: New best score: 1.165401\nGA Gen 14: New best score:\
