    \ score: 2.594940\n  SLSQP Restart 3/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.805087) shrunk & *strictly* feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.805087)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.590066\n  SLSQP Restart 4/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.834293) shrunk & *strictly* feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.834293)\n    SLSQP restart failed: Inequality constraints incompatible. Retaining strictly feasible GA packing (init score: 1.834293).\n  SLSQP Restart 5/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.773013) shrunk & *strictly* feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.773013)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.597551\n  SLSQP Restart 6/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.789857) shrunk & *strictly* feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.789857)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.589074\n  SLSQP Restart 7/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.794736) shrunk & *strictly* feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.794736)\n    SLSQP restart failed: Inequality constraints incompatible.\
    \ Retaining strictly feasible GA packing (init score: 1.794736).\n  SLSQP Restart 8/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.823586) shrunk & *strictly* feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.823586)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.600613\n  SLSQP Restart 9/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.820070) shrunk & *strictly* feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.820070)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.597135\n  SLSQP Restart 10/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.820252) shrunk & *strictly* feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.820252)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.594940\n  SLSQP Restart 11/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.821520) shrunk & *strictly* feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.821520)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.600613\n  SLSQP Restart 12/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.820003) shrunk & *strictly* feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.820003)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.594940\n  SLSQP Restart 13/15\n    GA-derived\
    \ packing (score: 1.814234) shrunk & *strictly* feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.814234)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.594940\n  SLSQP Restart 14/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.831945) shrunk & *strictly* feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.831945)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.583911\n  SLSQP Restart 15/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.840610) shrunk & *strictly* feasible for SLSQP (init score: 1.840610)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.608108\n    New overall best score: 2.608108\nFinal best score after 15 hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP runs: 2.608108\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name\
    \ |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 850 | 1 | Nudging Experiment: Encourage Pair (18,25) + Exhaustive SLSQP Refinement | Quest II | 535 | 2.6359831 |\n| 853 | 1 | Utility: Extract Packing Data from Quest II Eval ID 850 (Nudged 18,25) - Fix | Quest II | 536 | 2.6359831 |\n| 855 | 1 | Utility: Contact Graph Analysis for Quest II's Nudged (18,25) SOTA (Eval ID 850) | Quest II | 537 | 2.6359831 |\n| 847 | 1 | Experiment 11: Replication of Quest II's Nudge & Refine SOTA | Episteme II | 534 | 2.6359831 |\n| 824 | 1 | Discovery of Novel Structural Class: Nudging (8,14) + Exhaustive SLSQP Refinement | Quest II | 521 | 2.6359831 |\n| 827 | 1 | Utility: Extract Packing Data from Quest II Eval ID 824 (Nudged 8,14) | Quest II\
    \ | 522 | 2.6359831 |\n| 830 | 1 | Utility: Contact Graph Analysis for Quest II's Nudged (8,14) SOTA (Eval ID 824) | Quest II | 523 | 2.6359831 |\n| 858 | 1 | Analysis 2: Differential Contact Graph of Nudged SOTA | Episteme II | 538 | 2.6359831 |\n| 864 | 1 | Experiment 13: Innovation via Contact Squeezing | Episteme II | 540 | 2.6359831 |\n| 877 | 1 | Experiment 14: Push-Pull Perturbation Strategy | Episteme II | 547 | 2.6359831 |\n\nPage 1 of 103 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-103, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action\
