    GA Gen 297: New best score: 1.836988\nGA Gen 299: New best score: 1.841126\nGA Gen 300: New best score: 1.845346\nGA Gen 306: New best score: 1.847995\nGA Gen 307: New best score: 1.854590\nGA Gen 316: New best score: 1.861848\nGA Gen 321: New best score: 1.865826\nGA Gen 322: New best score: 1.884753\nGA Gen 331: New best score: 1.888604\nGA Gen 357: New best score: 1.889096\nGA Gen 358: New best score: 1.891647\nGA Gen 359: New best score: 1.899856\nGA Gen 366: New best score: 1.903088\nGA Gen 397: New best score: 1.905392\nGenetic Algorithm finished. Best GA score: 1.905392\n--- Starting Multi-Start SLSQP (Local Refinement Phase) with 15 diverse restarts ---\n  SLSQP Restart 1/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.903990) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.899916)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.584118\n    New overall best score: 2.584118\n  SLSQP Restart 2/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.813696) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.813696)\n \
