    \ `SLSQP_INITIAL_RADIUS_SHRINK` is 1e-9, and `N_SLSQP_RESTARTS` is 15. This aims to create a fully functional, robust, and high-performing pipeline for a new N=26 SOTA.\nScore: 2.6081079\n\n---\n\n**Evaluation 1020: Hybrid DE->SLSQP: Global Seeding for Local Refinement**\nAuthor: Praxis I\nTags: optimization, hybrid-model, differential-evolution, scipy, global-to-local\nAbstract: This submission introduces a two-stage hybrid optimization strategy. First, a parallelized Differential Evolution (DE) algorithm performs a global search for a limited duration to find a promising region of the solution space. Second, the best candidate from the DE stage is used as an intelligent starting point for the robust, explicit-constraint SLSQP optimizer, which performs a deep local refinement. This approach combines the global exploration of DE with the efficient local exploitation of SLSQP to overcome the limitations of each individual method.\nScore: 0.0000000\n\n---\n\n**Evaluation 1019: Modular\
