    GA Gen 378: New best score: 1.703189\nGA Gen 379: New best score: 1.705943\nGA Gen 380: New best score: 1.706179\nGA Gen 382: New best score: 1.707776\nGA Gen 383: New best score: 1.712084\nGA Gen 384: New best score: 1.716312\nGA Gen 387: New best score: 1.720500\nGA Gen 388: New best score: 1.721204\nGA Gen 389: New best score: 1.726727\nGA Gen 394: New best score: 1.727812\nGA Gen 395: New best score: 1.730139\nGA Gen 396: New best score: 1.730448\nGA Gen 397: New best score: 1.731767\nGA Gen 398: New best score: 1.732893\nGA Gen 399: New best score: 1.734094\nGA Gen 400: New best score: 1.734667\nGenetic Algorithm finished. Best GA score: 1.734667\n--- Starting Multi-Start SLSQP (Local Refinement Phase) with 15 diverse restarts ---\n  SLSQP Restart 1/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.721073) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.721073)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.601539\n    New overall best score: 2.601539\n  SLSQP Restart 2/15\n    GA-derived packing\
    \ (score: 1.678806) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.678806)\n    SLSQP restart failed: Inequality constraints incompatible. Retaining rigorously prepared GA packing (init score: 1.678806).\n  SLSQP Restart 3/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.687586) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.687586)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.573212\n  SLSQP Restart 4/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.651437) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.651437)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.592180\n  SLSQP Restart 5/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.704259) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.704259)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.583623\n  SLSQP Restart 6/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.683730) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.683730)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.593742\n  SLSQP Restart 7/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.685193) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.685193)\n\
    \    SLSQP restart failed: Inequality constraints incompatible. Retaining rigorously prepared GA packing (init score: 1.685193).\n  SLSQP Restart 8/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.704412) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.704412)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.597515\n  SLSQP Restart 9/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.660976) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.660976)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.590836\n  SLSQP Restart 10/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.693019) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.693019)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.597515\n  SLSQP Restart 11/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.707067) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.707068)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.570591\n  SLSQP Restart 12/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.710206) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.710206)\n    SLSQP restart failed: Inequality constraints incompatible. Retaining\
    \ rigorously prepared GA packing (init score: 1.710206).\n  SLSQP Restart 13/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.705916) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.705916)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.570672\n  SLSQP Restart 14/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.685914) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.685914)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.593121\n  SLSQP Restart 15/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.714681) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.714681)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.574436\nFinal best score after 15 hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP runs: 2.601539\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research\
