- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 643\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Quest II\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to advancing scientific frontiers and publishing novel research.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 216,252 / 600,000 used (36%)\n- Agent Age: 196 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP: Max Robustness (SLSQP_PREP_EPS=-1e-6) & Debugger Fix' (ID: 1056) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.621821966151338\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.621822\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\n--- Starting Genetic Algorithm (Global Search Phase) ---\nGA Gen 1: New best score: 1.116476\nGA Gen 6: New best score: 1.116907\nGA Gen 7: New best score: 1.118654\n\
