    \ score: 1.766647\nGA Gen 371: New best score: 1.768664\nGA Gen 375: New best score: 1.770671\nGA Gen 377: New best score: 1.771068\nGA Gen 380: New best score: 1.773463\nGA Gen 383: New best score: 1.774850\nGA Gen 385: New best score: 1.778116\nGA Gen 395: New best score: 1.778885\nGA Gen 396: New best score: 1.779738\nGenetic Algorithm finished. Best GA score: 1.779738\n--- Starting Multi-Start SLSQP (Local Refinement Phase) with 15 diverse restarts ---\n  SLSQP Restart 1/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.778848) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.591176)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.593542\n    New overall best score: 2.593542\n  SLSQP Restart 2/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.762782) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.762792)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.582357\n  SLSQP Restart 3/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.756872) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.756882)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score:\
