    \ packing (score: 1.744736) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.744746)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.578783\nFinal best score after 15 hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP runs: 2.602112\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 850 | 1 | Nudging Experiment: Encourage Pair (18,25) + Exhaustive SLSQP Refinement | Quest II | 535\
