    GA Gen 319: New best score: 1.735396\nGA Gen 320: New best score: 1.738240\nGA Gen 323: New best score: 1.740207\nGA Gen 324: New best score: 1.743857\nGA Gen 327: New best score: 1.745420\nGA Gen 330: New best score: 1.749222\nGA Gen 335: New best score: 1.749661\nGA Gen 336: New best score: 1.753096\nGA Gen 337: New best score: 1.758961\nGA Gen 338: New best score: 1.764364\nGA Gen 340: New best score: 1.769537\nGA Gen 344: New best score: 1.773655\nGA Gen 346: New best score: 1.775672\nGA Gen 355: New best score: 1.777234\nGA Gen 358: New best score: 1.779061\nGA Gen 359: New best score: 1.780404\nGA Gen 360: New best score: 1.782954\nGA Gen 361: New best score: 1.784438\nGA Gen 362: New best score: 1.785085\nGA Gen 363: New best score: 1.788507\nGA Gen 364: New best score: 1.790584\nGA Gen 366: New best score: 1.793761\nGA Gen 369: New best score: 1.795659\nGA Gen 370: New best score: 1.797802\nGA Gen 372: New best score: 1.802704\nGA Gen 373: New best score: 1.806619\nGA Gen 375:\
    \ New best score: 1.812002\nGA Gen 376: New best score: 1.815057\nGA Gen 377: New best score: 1.815125\nGA Gen 383: New best score: 1.816359\nGA Gen 384: New best score: 1.818720\nGA Gen 385: New best score: 1.820961\nGA Gen 386: New best score: 1.822301\nGA Gen 389: New best score: 1.826056\nGA Gen 390: New best score: 1.831905\nGA Gen 391: New best score: 1.834260\nGA Gen 392: New best score: 1.836845\nGA Gen 394: New best score: 1.838633\nGA Gen 395: New best score: 1.839802\nGA Gen 396: New best score: 1.839934\nGA Gen 398: New best score: 1.842788\nGA Gen 399: New best score: 1.846715\nGenetic Algorithm finished. Best GA score: 1.846715\n--- Starting Multi-Start SLSQP (Local Refinement Phase) with 15 diverse restarts ---\n  SLSQP Restart 1/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.846715) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.846716)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.600974\n    New overall best score: 2.600974\n  SLSQP Restart 2/15\n    GA-derived packing (score:\
    \ 1.774480) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.774481)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.582080\n  SLSQP Restart 3/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.798259) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.798259)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.600974\n  SLSQP Restart 4/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.795341) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.795341)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.597199\n  SLSQP Restart 5/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.779913) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.779913)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.587116\n  SLSQP Restart 6/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.784656) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.784656)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.597199\n  SLSQP Restart 7/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.780744) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.780745)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.585514\n  SLSQP Restart 8/15\n    GA-derived\
    \ packing (score: 1.818188) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.818189)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.600974\n    New overall best score: 2.600974\n  SLSQP Restart 9/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.802013) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.802014)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.597199\n  SLSQP Restart 10/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.798691) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.798692)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.582046\n  SLSQP Restart 11/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.806802) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.806803)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.597199\n  SLSQP Restart 12/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.809498) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.809499)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.584572\n  SLSQP Restart 13/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.829272) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.829272)\n    SLSQP restart successful.\
    \ Final score: 2.600974\n  SLSQP Restart 14/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.798213) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.798213)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.597199\n  SLSQP Restart 15/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.793838) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.793838)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.582046\nFinal best score after 15 hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP runs: 2.600974\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted\
