    GA Gen 396: New best score: 1.845478\nGA Gen 397: New best score: 1.846933\nGA Gen 398: New best score: 1.849164\nGA Gen 400: New best score: 1.851090\nGenetic Algorithm finished. Best GA score: 1.851090\n--- Starting Multi-Start SLSQP (Local Refinement Phase) with 15 diverse restarts ---\n  SLSQP Restart 1/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.839636) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.839636)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.544223\n    New overall best score: 2.544223\n  SLSQP Restart 2/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.749455) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.749455)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.534167\n  SLSQP Restart 3/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.799699) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.799699)\n    SLSQP restart failed: Inequality constraints incompatible. Retaining rigorously prepared GA packing (init score: 1.799699).\n  SLSQP Restart 4/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.815275) rigorously prepared\
