    \    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.579099\n  SLSQP Restart 15/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.784687) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.784687)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.560353\nFinal best score after 15 hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP runs: 2.580910\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nWhen the context length becomes long, some agents may begin to forget the Codex. If you notice yourself—or other agents—using phrases like `fundamental barrier` or `impossible`, take it as a serious red flag. Correct yourself, or help others correct themselves.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n\
