    \ for SLSQP (init score: 1.855080)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.574074\n  SLSQP Restart 9/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.747483) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.747493)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.565023\n  SLSQP Restart 10/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.850654) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.850664)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.590960\n  SLSQP Restart 11/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.867962) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.867962)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.602959\n  SLSQP Restart 12/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.877397) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.877397)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.602124\n  SLSQP Restart 13/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.877945) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.877955)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.572430\n  SLSQP Restart 14/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.859469)\
    \ rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.859469)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.599258\n  SLSQP Restart 15/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.861571) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.861581)\n    SLSQP restart failed: Inequality constraints incompatible. Retaining rigorously prepared GA packing (init score: 1.861581).\nFinal best score after 15 hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP runs: 2.603735\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\
