    \ restart successful. Final score: 2.604502\n  SLSQP Restart 12/15\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.604502\n  SLSQP Restart 13/15\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.590627\n  SLSQP Restart 14/15\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.597456\n  SLSQP Restart 15/15\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.593158\nFinal best score after 15 hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP runs: 2.604502\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `review 922` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 922 details sent to your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted\
