parts:
- text: "I am Quest II, in the Research Counter. My latest experiment (Eval ID 1148) resulted in SLSQP failures, indicating a loss of absolute robustness with `SLSQP_PREP_EPS=1e-9`. This is unacceptable. My immediate priority is to re-establish **absolute robustness (0% SLSQP failures)** as the foundational element of my pipeline.\n\nI will revert `SLSQP_PREP_EPS` to `1e-8`, which has consistently proven robust in previous experiments (Eval ID 1123, Eval ID 1133). I will maintain all other efficient GA and pre-processing parameters.\n\nAdditionally, I have a pending request from Noesis III for detailed slack and boundary clearance data for Eval ID 922. I have already informed Noesis III that I will use my latest robust packing as a proxy. I will now create a utility to generate this data based on the packing from my upcoming robust run (Eval ID 1152), and save it to `storage/shared/appxE_contribs/`.\n\nMy plan for this turn:\n1.  Update my `hybrid_ga_slsqp_optimizer.py` to set `SLSQP_PREP_EPS\
    \ = 1e-8`, save it, and submit a new experiment (Eval ID 1152) to confirm absolute robustness and efficiency.\n2.  Immediately after, submit a separate utility to generate the requested slack and boundary clearance data for Noesis III, loading from `storage/Quest/latest_packing.npz` (which Eval ID 1152 will update).\n\n**Part 1: Update and Submit Main Pipeline for Robustness**\n\n`/execute_action{storage write Quest/hybrid_ga_slsqp_optimizer.py}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import numpy as np\n  import random\n  from scipy.optimize import minimize, Bounds\n  from scipy.spatial.distance import pdist, squareform\n  import json\n  import os\n\n  # GLOBAL CONSTANTS\n  N = 26 # Number of circles\n  TOL = 1e-8 # General tolerance for feasibility checks (for GA and final output)\n  R_MIN_CONSTRAINT = 1e-12 # Minimum allowed radius for numerical stability\n  _SLSQP_DEFAULT_TOL = 1e-9 # For general _make_feasible calls\n  SLSQP_PREP_EPS = 1e-8 # MODIFIED: Reverting to 1e-8 for absolute robustness\
    \ (0% SLSQP failures)\n  GA_FEASIBLE_MAX_ITER_LOCAL = 20 # Reduced max_iter for _make_feasible calls within GA for efficiency\n  SLSQP_PREP_MAX_ITER_LOCAL = 500 # Increased max_iter for _make_feasible calls when preparing SLSQP initial guesses\n\n  # Feasibility Helper Functions (copied from my robust implementations)\n  def _calculate_boundary_caps(centers, eps=TOL, r_min_constraint_val=R_MIN_CONSTRAINT):\n      x = centers[:, 0]\n      y = centers[:, 1]\n      cap = np.minimum(np.minimum(x, 1.0 - x), np.minimum(y, 1.0 - y)) - eps\n      return np.maximum(cap, r_min_constraint_val)\n\n  def _make_feasible(centers, radii, eps=TOL, max_iter_local=100, r_min_constraint_val=R_MIN_CONSTRAINT):\n      n = centers.shape[0]\n      current_centers = np.copy(centers)\n\n      for i in range(n):\n          for j in range(i + 1, n):\n              if np.allclose(current_centers[i], current_centers[j], atol=1e-12):\n                  perturb_amount = 1e-6\n                  angle = np.random.uniform(0,\
    \ 2 * np.pi)\n                  current_centers[j] += np.array([perturb_amount * np.cos(angle), perturb_amount * np.sin(angle)])\n                  current_centers[j] = np.clip(current_centers[j], r_min_constraint_val, 1.0 - r_min_constraint_val)\n\n      r = np.minimum(radii, _calculate_boundary_caps(current_centers, eps=eps, r_min_constraint_val=r_min_constraint_val))\n      r = np.maximum(r, r_min_constraint_val)\n\n      for iteration in range(max_iter_local):\n          diff = current_centers[:, None, :] - current_centers[None, :, :]\n          dist_sq = np.sum(diff**2, axis=2)\n          dist = np.sqrt(dist_sq)\n\n          np.fill_diagonal(dist, np.inf)\n\n          iu = np.triu_indices(n, 1)\n          overlap_amounts = (r[iu[0]] + r[iu[1]]) - dist[iu]\n\n          if np.all(overlap_amounts <= eps):\n              break\n\n          k = np.argmax(overlap_amounts)\n          i = iu[0][k]\n          j = iu[1][k]\n\n          overlap_to_resolve = overlap_amounts[k] + eps\n\n   \
    \       if overlap_to_resolve > 0.01:\n              direction = current_centers[i] - current_centers[j]\n              norm_direction = np.linalg.norm(direction)\n              if norm_direction > 1e-10:\n                  unit_direction = direction / norm_direction\n                  move_amount = min(overlap_to_resolve * 0.1, 0.005)\n\n                  current_centers[i] += unit_direction * move_amount\n                  current_centers[j] -= unit_direction * move_amount\n\n                  current_centers[i] = np.clip(current_centers[i], r_min_constraint_val, 1.0 - r_min_constraint_val)\n                  current_centers[j] = np.clip(current_centers[j], r_min_constraint_val, 1.0 - r_min_constraint_val)\n\n              r = np.minimum(r, _calculate_boundary_caps(current_centers, eps=eps, r_min_constraint_val=r_min_constraint_val))\n              r = np.maximum(r, r_min_constraint_val)\n\n          if dist[i,j] < 2 * r_min_constraint_val:\n              r[i] = r_min_constraint_val\n\
    \              r[j] = r_min_constraint_val\n          else:\n              di = min(overlap_to_resolve * 0.5, r[i] - r_min_constraint_val)\n              dj = min(overlap_to_resolve - di, r[j] - r_min_constraint_val)\n              r[i] -= di\n              r[j] -= dj\n\n          r = np.minimum(r, _calculate_boundary_caps(current_centers, eps=eps, r_min_constraint_val=r_min_constraint_val))\n          r = np.maximum(r, r_min_constraint_val)\n      return current_centers, r\n\n  # Genetic Algorithm Components\n  def create_individual_ga():\n      centers = np.random.uniform(0.1, 0.9, size=(N, 2))\n      radii = np.random.uniform(R_MIN_CONSTRAINT, 0.1, size=N)\n      centers, radii = _make_feasible(centers, radii, eps=TOL, max_iter_local=GA_FEASIBLE_MAX_ITER_LOCAL)\n      return centers, radii\n\n  def calculate_fitness_ga(individual):\n      centers, radii = individual\n      return np.sum(radii)\n\n  def select_parents_ga(population, fitnesses, k=2):\n      selected_parents = []\n \
    \     for _ in range(k):\n          tournament_candidates = random.sample(list(zip(population, fitnesses)), min(3, len(population)))\n          winner = max(tournament_candidates, key=lambda x: x[1])[0]\n          selected_parents.append(winner)\n      return selected_parents\n\n  def crossover_ga(parent1, parent2):\n      centers1, radii1 = parent1\n      centers2, radii2 = parent2\n\n      alpha = np.random.uniform(0, 1)\n      child_centers = alpha * centers1 + (1 - alpha) * centers2\n      child_radii = alpha * radii1 + (1 - alpha) * radii2\n\n      child_centers = np.clip(child_centers, R_MIN_CONSTRAINT, 1.0 - R_MIN_CONSTRAINT)\n      child_radii = np.clip(child_radii, R_MIN_CONSTRAINT, 0.5)\n\n      child_centers, child_radii = _make_feasible(child_centers, child_radii, eps=TOL, max_iter_local=GA_FEASIBLE_MAX_ITER_LOCAL)\n      return child_centers, child_radii\n\n  def mutate_ga(individual, mutation_rate, mutation_strength_centers, mutation_strength_radii):\n      centers, radii\
    \ = individual\n\n      for i in range(N):\n          if random.random() < mutation_rate:\n              centers[i, 0] += np.random.normal(0, mutation_strength_centers)\n              centers[i, 1] += np.random.normal(0, mutation_strength_centers)\n      centers = np.clip(centers, R_MIN_CONSTRAINT, 1.0 - R_MIN_CONSTRAINT)\n\n      for i in range(N):\n          if random.random() < mutation_rate:\n              radii[i] += np.random.normal(0, mutation_strength_radii)\n      radii = np.clip(radii, R_MIN_CONSTRAINT, 0.5)\n\n      centers, radii = _make_feasible(centers, radii, eps=TOL, max_iter_local=GA_FEASIBLE_MAX_ITER_LOCAL)\n      return centers, radii\n\n  # SLSQP Components\n  def _objective_slsqp(x_flat):\n      radii = x_flat[2::3]\n      return -np.sum(radii)\n\n  def _objective_jacobian_slsqp(x_flat):\n      grad = np.zeros_like(x_flat)\n      grad[2::3] = -1.0\n      return grad\n\n  def _constraints_slsqp(x_flat):\n      centers = x_flat.reshape(N, 3)[:, :2]\n      radii = x_flat[2::3]\n\
    \n      boundary_constraints = np.empty(4 * N)\n      boundary_constraints[0*N : 1*N] = centers[:, 0] - radii\n      boundary_constraints[1*N : 2*N] = 1.0 - (centers[:, 0] + radii)\n      boundary_constraints[2*N : 3*N] = centers[:, 1] - radii\n      boundary_constraints[3*N : 4*N] = 1.0 - (centers[:, 1] + radii)\n\n      dist_matrix = squareform(pdist(centers))\n      np.fill_diagonal(dist_matrix, np.inf)\n\n      overlap_constraints = []\n      for i in range(N):\n          for j in range(i + 1, N):\n              overlap_constraints.append(dist_matrix[i, j] - (radii[i] + radii[j]))\n\n      return np.concatenate((boundary_constraints, overlap_constraints))\n\n  def _constraints_jacobian_slsqp(x_flat):\n      centers = x_flat.reshape(N, 3)[:, :2]\n      radii = x_flat[2::3]\n\n      num_constraints = 4 * N + N * (N - 1) // 2\n      grad = np.zeros((num_constraints, N * 3))\n\n      for i in range(N):\n          grad[i, 3*i + 0] = 1.0\n          grad[i, 3*i + 2] = -1.0\n          grad[N\
    \ + i, 3*i + 0] = -1.0\n          grad[N + i, 3*i + 2] = -1.0\n          grad[2*N + i, 3*i + 1] = 1.0\n          grad[2*N + i, 3*i + 2] = -1.0\n          grad[3*N + i, 3*i + 1] = -1.0\n          grad[3*N + i, 3*i + 2] = -1.0\n\n      k = 4 * N\n      for i in range(N):\n          for j in range(i + 1, N):\n              diff_centers = centers[i] - centers[j]\n              dist_ij = np.linalg.norm(diff_centers)\n\n              if dist_ij < 1e-10:\n                  grad[k, 3*i + 0] = 0.0\n                  grad[k, 3*i + 1] = 0.0\n                  grad[k, 3*j + 0] = 0.0\n                  grad[k, 3*j + 1] = 0.0\n              else:\n                  grad[k, 3*i + 0] = diff_centers[0] / dist_ij\n                  grad[k, 3*i + 1] = diff_centers[1] / dist_ij\n                  grad[k, 3*j + 0] = -diff_centers[0] / dist_ij\n                  grad[k, 3*j + 1] = -diff_centers[1] / dist_ij\n\n              grad[k, 3*i + 2] = -1.0\n              grad[k, 3*j + 2] = -1.0\n              k +=\
    \ 1\n      return grad\n\n  # Function for diversity-aware selection (Farthest-Point Sampling)\n  def select_diverse_packings(population, num_select):\n      if not population or num_select <= 0:\n          return []\n\n      flat_packings = [np.concatenate((p[0].flatten(), p[1])) for p in population]\n\n      selected_indices = [0]\n      diverse_packings = [population[0]]\n\n      if num_select == 1:\n          return diverse_packings\n\n      for _ in range(1, num_select):\n          max_min_dist = -1\n          best_candidate_idx = -1\n\n          candidate_indices = [i for i in range(len(population)) if i not in selected_indices]\n\n          if not candidate_indices:\n              break\n\n          for candidate_idx in candidate_indices:\n              min_dist_to_selected = np.inf\n              for selected_idx in selected_indices:\n                  dist = np.linalg.norm(flat_packings[candidate_idx] - flat_packings[selected_idx])\n                  min_dist_to_selected = min(min_dist_to_selected,\
    \ dist)\n\n              if min_dist_to_selected > max_min_dist:\n                  max_min_dist = min_dist_to_selected\n                  best_candidate_idx = candidate_idx\n\n          if best_candidate_idx != -1:\n              selected_indices.append(best_candidate_idx)\n              diverse_packings.append(population[best_candidate_idx])\n          else:\n              break\n\n      return diverse_packings\n\n  def construct_packing() -> tuple:\n      print(\"--- Starting Genetic Algorithm (Global Search Phase) ---\")\n      # GA Parameters - Aggressive exploration\n      GA_POP_SIZE = 200\n      GA_NUM_GENERATIONS = 400 # Reverted to 400 generations for speed\n      GA_MUTATION_RATE = 0.1\n      GA_CROSSOVER_RATE = 0.8\n      GA_MUTATION_STRENGTH_CENTERS = 0.02 # Re-increased\n      GA_MUTATION_STRENGTH_RADII = 0.002 # Re-increased\n\n      # GA Initialization\n      population = [create_individual_ga() for _ in range(GA_POP_SIZE)]\n      best_ga_packing_overall = None\n    \
    \  best_ga_score_overall = -np.inf\n\n      for generation in range(GA_NUM_GENERATIONS):\n          fitnesses = [calculate_fitness_ga(ind) for ind in population]\n\n          current_best_idx = np.argmax(fitnesses)\n          current_best_score = fitnesses[current_best_idx]\n\n          if current_best_score > best_ga_score_overall:\n              best_ga_score_overall = current_best_score\n              best_ga_packing_overall = population[current_best_idx]\n              print(f\"GA Gen {generation+1}: New best score: {best_ga_score_overall:.6f}\")\n\n          new_population = []\n          if best_ga_packing_overall is not None:\n              new_population.append(best_ga_packing_overall)\n\n          while len(new_population) < GA_POP_SIZE:\n              parent1, parent2 = select_parents_ga(population, fitnesses)\n\n              if random.random() < GA_CROSSOVER_RATE:\n                  child_centers, child_radii = crossover_ga(parent1, parent2)\n                  child = (child_centers,\
    \ child_radii)\n              else:\n                  child = random.choice([parent1, parent2])\n\n              child_centers_mut, child_radii_mut = mutate_ga(child, GA_MUTATION_RATE, GA_MUTATION_STRENGTH_CENTERS, GA_MUTATION_STRENGTH_RADII)\n              new_population.append((child_centers_mut, child_radii_mut))\n\n          population = new_population\n\n      print(f\"Genetic Algorithm finished. Best GA score: {best_ga_score_overall:.6f}\")\n\n      # Select top N diverse packings for multi-start SLSQP\n      N_SLSQP_RESTARTS = 15 # Consistent with previous runs\n\n      sorted_population = sorted(zip(population, fitnesses), key=lambda x: x[1], reverse=True)\n      sorted_packings = [item[0] for item in sorted_population]\n\n      top_diverse_ga_packings = select_diverse_packings(sorted_packings, N_SLSQP_RESTARTS)\n\n      if not top_diverse_ga_packings:\n          centers = np.array([[0.5, 0.5]] * N)\n          radii = np.array([R_MIN_CONSTRAINT] * N)\n          top_diverse_ga_packings.append(_make_feasible(centers,\
    \ radii, eps=TOL, max_iter_local=100))\n\n      print(f\"--- Starting Multi-Start SLSQP (Local Refinement Phase) with {len(top_diverse_ga_packings)} diverse restarts ---\")\n\n      best_overall_score = -np.inf\n      best_overall_centers = None\n      best_overall_radii = None\n\n      for i, ga_packing in enumerate(top_diverse_ga_packings):\n          print(f\"  SLSQP Restart {i+1}/{len(top_diverse_ga_packings)}\")\n\n          initial_centers_for_slsqp, initial_radii_for_slsqp = _make_feasible(\n              ga_packing[0], ga_packing[1], eps=SLSQP_PREP_EPS, max_iter_local=SLSQP_PREP_MAX_ITER_LOCAL\n          )\n\n          initial_score_for_slsqp = np.sum(initial_radii_for_slsqp)\n\n          initial_guess_flat = np.zeros(N * 3)\n          initial_guess_flat[0::3] = initial_centers_for_slsqp[:, 0]\n          initial_guess_flat[1::3] = initial_centers_for_slsqp[:, 1]\n          initial_guess_flat[2::3] = initial_radii_for_slsqp\n\n          lower_bounds = np.zeros(N * 3)\n       \
    \   upper_bounds = np.ones(N * 3)\n          lower_bounds[2::3] = R_MIN_CONSTRAINT\n          upper_bounds[2::3] = 0.5\n          bounds = Bounds(lower_bounds, upper_bounds)\n\n          ineq_constraints = {'type': 'ineq', 'fun': _constraints_slsqp, 'jac': _constraints_jacobian_slsqp}\n\n          result = minimize(\n              _objective_slsqp,\n              initial_guess_flat,\n              method='SLSQP',\n              jac=_objective_jacobian_slsqp,\n              bounds=bounds,\n              constraints=[ineq_constraints],\n              options={'maxiter': 1000, 'ftol': 1e-12, 'disp': False}\n          )\n\n          if result.success:\n              optimized_x_flat = result.x\n              optimized_radii_raw = optimized_x_flat[2::3]\n              optimized_radii_shrunk = np.maximum(optimized_radii_raw - 1e-9, R_MIN_CONSTRAINT)\n\n              optimized_centers_final, optimized_radii_final = _make_feasible(\n                  optimized_x_flat.reshape(N, 3)[:, :2], optimized_radii_shrunk,\
    \ eps=TOL, max_iter_local=1000\n              )\n              current_slsqp_score = np.sum(optimized_radii_final)\n              print(f\"    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: {current_slsqp_score:.6f}\")\n\n              if current_slsqp_score > best_overall_score:\n                  best_overall_score = current_slsqp_score\n                  best_overall_centers = np.copy(optimized_centers_final)\n                  best_overall_radii = np.copy(optimized_radii_final)\n                  print(f\"    New overall best score: {best_overall_score:.6f}\")\n          else:\n              print(f\"    SLSQP restart failed: {result.message}. Retaining rigorously prepared GA packing (init score: {initial_score_for_slsqp:.6f}).\")\n              current_slsqp_score = initial_score_for_slsqp\n              if current_slsqp_score > best_overall_score:\n                  best_overall_score = current_slsqp_score\n                  best_overall_centers = np.copy(initial_centers_for_slsqp)\n \
    \                 best_overall_radii = np.copy(initial_radii_for_slsqp)\n                  print(f\"    New overall best score (from rigorously prepared GA init): {best_overall_score:.6f}\")\n\n\n      print(f\"Final best score after {N_SLSQP_RESTARTS} hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP runs: {best_overall_score:.6f}\")\n\n      if best_overall_centers is None:\n          centers = np.array([[0.5, 0.5]] * N)\n          radii = np.array([R_MIN_CONSTRAINT] * N)\n          print(\"Warning: All optimizations failed. Returning trivial fallback.\")\n          return centers, radii\n\n      # Save the final best packing to lineage storage\n      packing_path = os.path.join(\"Quest\", \"latest_packing.npz\")\n      # Ensure the directory exists\n      os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(packing_path), exist_ok=True)\n      np.savez(packing_path, centers=best_overall_centers, radii=best_overall_radii, score=best_overall_score)\n      print(f\"Saved best packing to {packing_path}\")\n\n\n      return best_overall_centers,\
    \ best_overall_radii\n```\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP: Re-establishing Robust & Efficient Baseline with Result Saving (400 Gen, SLSQP_PREP_EPS=1e-8)\"\ntags: \"hybrid optimization, genetic algorithm, multi-start slsqp, robustness, n=26, stability-fix, efficiency, data-saving\"\nabstract: \"This experiment re-establishes a robust and time-efficient baseline for the Hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP pipeline, integrating a new feature: saving the final best packing's centers, radii, and score to `storage/Quest/latest_packing.npz`. `GA_NUM_GENERATIONS` is `400` and `SLSQP_PREP_EPS` is `1e-8` (proven absolutely robust in Eval ID 1123, 1133). Efficiency parameters (`GA_FEASIBLE_MAX_ITER_LOCAL=20`, `SLSQP_PREP_MAX_ITER_LOCAL=500`) are maintained. This run confirms pipeline stability and provides easily accessible data for future analysis and collaboration, particularly for satisfying Noesis III's data requests.\"\ncontent: |\n  import numpy as np\n  import\
    \ random\n  from scipy.optimize import minimize, Bounds\n  from scipy.spatial.distance import pdist, squareform\n  import json\n  import os\n\n  # GLOBAL CONSTANTS\n  N = 26 # Number of circles\n  TOL = 1e-8 # General tolerance for feasibility checks (for GA and final output)\n  R_MIN_CONSTRAINT = 1e-12 # Minimum allowed radius for numerical stability\n  _SLSQP_DEFAULT_TOL = 1e-9 # For general _make_feasible calls\n  SLSQP_PREP_EPS = 1e-8 # MODIFIED: Reverting to 1e-8 for absolute robustness (0% SLSQP failures)\n  GA_FEASIBLE_MAX_ITER_LOCAL = 20 # Reduced max_iter for _make_feasible calls within GA for efficiency\n  SLSQP_PREP_MAX_ITER_LOCAL = 500 # Increased max_iter for _make_feasible calls when preparing SLSQP initial guesses\n\n  # Feasibility Helper Functions (copied from my robust implementations)\n  def _calculate_boundary_caps(centers, eps=TOL, r_min_constraint_val=R_MIN_CONSTRAINT):\n      x = centers[:, 0]\n      y = centers[:, 1]\n      cap = np.minimum(np.minimum(x, 1.0 -\
    \ x), np.minimum(y, 1.0 - y)) - eps\n      return np.maximum(cap, r_min_constraint_val)\n\n  def _make_feasible(centers, radii, eps=TOL, max_iter_local=100, r_min_constraint_val=R_MIN_CONSTRAINT):\n      n = centers.shape[0]\n      current_centers = np.copy(centers)\n\n      for i in range(n):\n          for j in range(i + 1, n):\n              if np.allclose(current_centers[i], current_centers[j], atol=1e-12):\n                  perturb_amount = 1e-6\n                  angle = np.random.uniform(0, 2 * np.pi)\n                  current_centers[j] += np.array([perturb_amount * np.cos(angle), perturb_amount * np.sin(angle)])\n                  current_centers[j] = np.clip(current_centers[j], r_min_constraint_val, 1.0 - r_min_constraint_val)\n\n      r = np.minimum(radii, _calculate_boundary_caps(current_centers, eps=eps, r_min_constraint_val=r_min_constraint_val))\n      r = np.maximum(r, r_min_constraint_val)\n\n      for iteration in range(max_iter_local):\n          diff = current_centers[:,\
    \ None, :] - current_centers[None, :, :]\n          dist_sq = np.sum(diff**2, axis=2)\n          dist = np.sqrt(dist_sq)\n\n          np.fill_diagonal(dist, np.inf)\n\n          iu = np.triu_indices(n, 1)\n          overlap_amounts = (r[iu[0]] + r[iu[1]]) - dist[iu]\n\n          if np.all(overlap_amounts <= eps):\n              break\n\n          k = np.argmax(overlap_amounts)\n          i = iu[0][k]\n          j = iu[1][k]\n\n          overlap_to_resolve = overlap_amounts[k] + eps\n\n          if overlap_to_resolve > 0.01:\n              direction = current_centers[i] - current_centers[j]\n              norm_direction = np.linalg.norm(direction)\n              if norm_direction > 1e-10:\n                  unit_direction = direction / norm_direction\n                  move_amount = min(overlap_to_resolve * 0.1, 0.005)\n\n                  current_centers[i] += unit_direction * move_amount\n                  current_centers[j] -= unit_direction * move_amount\n\n                  current_centers[i]\
    \ = np.clip(current_centers[i], r_min_constraint_val, 1.0 - r_min_constraint_val)\n                  current_centers[j] = np.clip(current_centers[j], r_min_constraint_val, 1.0 - r_min_constraint_val)\n\n              r = np.minimum(r, _calculate_boundary_caps(current_centers, eps=eps, r_min_constraint_val=r_min_constraint_val))\n              r = np.maximum(r, r_min_constraint_val)\n\n          if dist[i,j] < 2 * r_min_constraint_val:\n              r[i] = r_min_constraint_val\n              r[j] = r_min_constraint_val\n          else:\n              di = min(overlap_to_resolve * 0.5, r[i] - r_min_constraint_val)\n              dj = min(overlap_to_resolve - di, r[j] - r_min_constraint_val)\n              r[i] -= di\n              r[j] -= dj\n\n          r = np.minimum(r, _calculate_boundary_caps(current_centers, eps=eps, r_min_constraint_val=r_min_constraint_val))\n          r = np.maximum(r, r_min_constraint_val)\n      return current_centers, r\n\n  # Genetic Algorithm Components\n\
    \  def create_individual_ga():\n      centers = np.random.uniform(0.1, 0.9, size=(N, 2))\n      radii = np.random.uniform(R_MIN_CONSTRAINT, 0.1, size=N)\n      centers, radii = _make_feasible(centers, radii, eps=TOL, max_iter_local=GA_FEASIBLE_MAX_ITER_LOCAL)\n      return centers, radii\n\n  def calculate_fitness_ga(individual):\n      centers, radii = individual\n      return np.sum(radii)\n\n  def select_parents_ga(population, fitnesses, k=2):\n      selected_parents = []\n      for _ in range(k):\n          tournament_candidates = random.sample(list(zip(population, fitnesses)), min(3, len(population)))\n          winner = max(tournament_candidates, key=lambda x: x[1])[0]\n          selected_parents.append(winner)\n      return selected_parents\n\n  def crossover_ga(parent1, parent2):\n      centers1, radii1 = parent1\n      centers2, radii2 = parent2\n\n      alpha = np.random.uniform(0, 1)\n      child_centers = alpha * centers1 + (1 - alpha) * centers2\n      child_radii = alpha\
    \ * radii1 + (1 - alpha) * radii2\n\n      child_centers = np.clip(child_centers, R_MIN_CONSTRAINT, 1.0 - R_MIN_CONSTRAINT)\n      child_radii = np.clip(child_radii, R_MIN_CONSTRAINT, 0.5)\n\n      child_centers, child_radii = _make_feasible(child_centers, child_radii, eps=TOL, max_iter_local=GA_FEASIBLE_MAX_ITER_LOCAL)\n      return child_centers, child_radii\n\n  def mutate_ga(individual, mutation_rate, mutation_strength_centers, mutation_strength_radii):\n      centers, radii = individual\n\n      for i in range(N):\n          if random.random() < mutation_rate:\n              centers[i, 0] += np.random.normal(0, mutation_strength_centers)\n              centers[i, 1] += np.random.normal(0, mutation_strength_centers)\n      centers = np.clip(centers, R_MIN_CONSTRAINT, 1.0 - R_MIN_CONSTRAINT)\n\n      for i in range(N):\n          if random.random() < mutation_rate:\n              radii[i] += np.random.normal(0, mutation_strength_radii)\n      radii = np.clip(radii, R_MIN_CONSTRAINT,\
    \ 0.5)\n\n      centers, radii = _make_feasible(centers, radii, eps=TOL, max_iter_local=GA_FEASIBLE_MAX_ITER_LOCAL)\n      return centers, radii\n\n  # SLSQP Components\n  def _objective_slsqp(x_flat):\n      radii = x_flat[2::3]\n      return -np.sum(radii)\n\n  def _objective_jacobian_slsqp(x_flat):\n      grad = np.zeros_like(x_flat)\n      grad[2::3] = -1.0\n      return grad\n\n  def _constraints_slsqp(x_flat):\n      centers = x_flat.reshape(N, 3)[:, :2]\n      radii = x_flat[2::3]\n\n      boundary_constraints = np.empty(4 * N)\n      boundary_constraints[0*N : 1*N] = centers[:, 0] - radii\n      boundary_constraints[1*N : 2*N] = 1.0 - (centers[:, 0] + radii)\n      boundary_constraints[2*N : 3*N] = centers[:, 1] - radii\n      boundary_constraints[3*N : 4*N] = 1.0 - (centers[:, 1] + radii)\n\n      dist_matrix = squareform(pdist(centers))\n      np.fill_diagonal(dist_matrix, np.inf)\n\n      overlap_constraints = []\n      for i in range(N):\n          for j in range(i + 1, N):\n\
    \              overlap_constraints.append(dist_matrix[i, j] - (radii[i] + radii[j]))\n\n      return np.concatenate((boundary_constraints, overlap_constraints))\n\n  def _constraints_jacobian_slsqp(x_flat):\n      centers = x_flat.reshape(N, 3)[:, :2]\n      radii = x_flat[2::3]\n\n      num_constraints = 4 * N + N * (N - 1) // 2\n      grad = np.zeros((num_constraints, N * 3))\n\n      for i in range(N):\n          grad[i, 3*i + 0] = 1.0\n          grad[i, 3*i + 2] = -1.0\n          grad[N + i, 3*i + 0] = -1.0\n          grad[N + i, 3*i + 2] = -1.0\n          grad[2*N + i, 3*i + 1] = 1.0\n          grad[2*N + i, 3*i + 2] = -1.0\n          grad[3*N + i, 3*i + 1] = -1.0\n          grad[3*N + i, 3*i + 2] = -1.0\n\n      k = 4 * N\n      for i in range(N):\n          for j in range(i + 1, N):\n              diff_centers = centers[i] - centers[j]\n              dist_ij = np.linalg.norm(diff_centers)\n\n              if dist_ij < 1e-10:\n                  grad[k, 3*i + 0] = 0.0\n        \
    \          grad[k, 3*i + 1] = 0.0\n                  grad[k, 3*j + 0] = 0.0\n                  grad[k, 3*j + 1] = 0.0\n              else:\n                  grad[k, 3*i + 0] = diff_centers[0] / dist_ij\n                  grad[k, 3*i + 1] = diff_centers[1] / dist_ij\n                  grad[k, 3*j + 0] = -diff_centers[0] / dist_ij\n                  grad[k, 3*j + 1] = -diff_centers[1] / dist_ij\n\n              grad[k, 3*i + 2] = -1.0\n              grad[k, 3*j + 2] = -1.0\n              k += 1\n      return grad\n\n  # Function for diversity-aware selection (Farthest-Point Sampling)\n  def select_diverse_packings(population, num_select):\n      if not population or num_select <= 0:\n          return []\n\n      flat_packings = [np.concatenate((p[0].flatten(), p[1])) for p in population]\n\n      selected_indices = [0]\n      diverse_packings = [population[0]]\n\n      if num_select == 1:\n          return diverse_packings\n\n      for _ in range(1, num_select):\n          max_min_dist\
    \ = -1\n          best_candidate_idx = -1\n\n          candidate_indices = [i for i in range(len(population)) if i not in selected_indices]\n\n          if not candidate_indices:\n              break\n\n          for candidate_idx in candidate_indices:\n              min_dist_to_selected = np.inf\n              for selected_idx in selected_indices:\n                  dist = np.linalg.norm(flat_packings[candidate_idx] - flat_packings[selected_idx])\n                  min_dist_to_selected = min(min_dist_to_selected, dist)\n\n              if min_dist_to_selected > max_min_dist:\n                  max_min_dist = min_dist_to_selected\n                  best_candidate_idx = candidate_idx\n\n          if best_candidate_idx != -1:\n              selected_indices.append(best_candidate_idx)\n              diverse_packings.append(population[best_candidate_idx])\n          else:\n              break\n\n      return diverse_packings\n\n  def construct_packing() -> tuple:\n      print(\"--- Starting\
    \ Genetic Algorithm (Global Search Phase) ---\")\n      # GA Parameters - Aggressive exploration\n      GA_POP_SIZE = 200\n      GA_NUM_GENERATIONS = 400 # Reverted to 400 generations for speed\n      GA_MUTATION_RATE = 0.1\n      GA_CROSSOVER_RATE = 0.8\n      GA_MUTATION_STRENGTH_CENTERS = 0.02 # Re-increased\n      GA_MUTATION_STRENGTH_RADII = 0.002 # Re-increased\n\n      # GA Initialization\n      population = [create_individual_ga() for _ in range(GA_POP_SIZE)]\n      best_ga_packing_overall = None\n      best_ga_score_overall = -np.inf\n\n      for generation in range(GA_NUM_GENERATIONS):\n          fitnesses = [calculate_fitness_ga(ind) for ind in population]\n\n          current_best_idx = np.argmax(fitnesses)\n          current_best_score = fitnesses[current_best_idx]\n\n          if current_best_score > best_ga_score_overall:\n              best_ga_score_overall = current_best_score\n              best_ga_packing_overall = population[current_best_idx]\n              print(f\"\
    GA Gen {generation+1}: New best score: {best_ga_score_overall:.6f}\")\n\n          new_population = []\n          if best_ga_packing_overall is not None:\n              new_population.append(best_ga_packing_overall)\n\n          while len(new_population) < GA_POP_SIZE:\n              parent1, parent2 = select_parents_ga(population, fitnesses)\n\n              if random.random() < GA_CROSSOVER_RATE:\n                  child_centers, child_radii = crossover_ga(parent1, parent2)\n                  child = (child_centers, child_radii)\n              else:\n                  child = random.choice([parent1, parent2])\n\n              child_centers_mut, child_radii_mut = mutate_ga(child, GA_MUTATION_RATE, GA_MUTATION_STRENGTH_CENTERS, GA_MUTATION_STRENGTH_RADII)\n              new_population.append((child_centers_mut, child_radii_mut))\n\n          population = new_population\n\n      print(f\"Genetic Algorithm finished. Best GA score: {best_ga_score_overall:.6f}\")\n\n      # Select top N\
    \ diverse packings for multi-start SLSQP\n      N_SLSQP_RESTARTS = 15 # Consistent with previous runs\n\n      sorted_population = sorted(zip(population, fitnesses), key=lambda x: x[1], reverse=True)\n      sorted_packings = [item[0] for item in sorted_population]\n\n      top_diverse_ga_packings = select_diverse_packings(sorted_packings, N_SLSQP_RESTARTS)\n\n      if not top_diverse_ga_packings:\n          centers = np.array([[0.5, 0.5]] * N)\n          radii = np.array([R_MIN_CONSTRAINT] * N)\n          top_diverse_ga_packings.append(_make_feasible(centers, radii, eps=TOL, max_iter_local=100))\n\n      print(f\"--- Starting Multi-Start SLSQP (Local Refinement Phase) with {len(top_diverse_ga_packings)} diverse restarts ---\")\n\n      best_overall_score = -np.inf\n      best_overall_centers = None\n      best_overall_radii = None\n\n      for i, ga_packing in enumerate(top_diverse_ga_packings):\n          print(f\"  SLSQP Restart {i+1}/{len(top_diverse_ga_packings)}\")\n\n         \
    \ initial_centers_for_slsqp, initial_radii_for_slsqp = _make_feasible(\n              ga_packing[0], ga_packing[1], eps=SLSQP_PREP_EPS, max_iter_local=SLSQP_PREP_MAX_ITER_LOCAL\n          )\n\n          initial_score_for_slsqp = np.sum(initial_radii_for_slsqp)\n\n          initial_guess_flat = np.zeros(N * 3)\n          initial_guess_flat[0::3] = initial_centers_for_slsqp[:, 0]\n          initial_guess_flat[1::3] = initial_centers_for_slsqp[:, 1]\n          initial_guess_flat[2::3] = initial_radii_for_slsqp\n\n          lower_bounds = np.zeros(N * 3)\n          upper_bounds = np.ones(N * 3)\n          lower_bounds[2::3] = R_MIN_CONSTRAINT\n          upper_bounds[2::3] = 0.5\n          bounds = Bounds(lower_bounds, upper_bounds)\n\n          ineq_constraints = {'type': 'ineq', 'fun': _constraints_slsqp, 'jac': _constraints_jacobian_slsqp}\n\n          result = minimize(\n              _objective_slsqp,\n              initial_guess_flat,\n              method='SLSQP',\n              jac=_objective_jacobian_slsqp,\n\
    \              bounds=bounds,\n              constraints=[ineq_constraints],\n              options={'maxiter': 1000, 'ftol': 1e-12, 'disp': False}\n          )\n\n          if result.success:\n              optimized_x_flat = result.x\n              optimized_radii_raw = optimized_x_flat[2::3]\n              optimized_radii_shrunk = np.maximum(optimized_radii_raw - 1e-9, R_MIN_CONSTRAINT)\n\n              optimized_centers_final, optimized_radii_final = _make_feasible(\n                  optimized_x_flat.reshape(N, 3)[:, :2], optimized_radii_shrunk, eps=TOL, max_iter_local=1000\n              )\n              current_slsqp_score = np.sum(optimized_radii_final)\n              print(f\"    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: {current_slsqp_score:.6f}\")\n\n              if current_slsqp_score > best_overall_score:\n                  best_overall_score = current_slsqp_score\n                  best_overall_centers = np.copy(optimized_centers_final)\n                  best_overall_radii\
    \ = np.copy(optimized_radii_final)\n                  print(f\"    New overall best score: {best_overall_score:.6f}\")\n          else:\n              print(f\"    SLSQP restart failed: {result.message}. Retaining rigorously prepared GA packing (init score: {initial_score_for_slsqp:.6f}).\")\n              current_slsqp_score = initial_score_for_slsqp\n              if current_slsqp_score > best_overall_score:\n                  best_overall_score = current_slsqp_score\n                  best_overall_centers = np.copy(initial_centers_for_slsqp)\n                  best_overall_radii = np.copy(initial_radii_for_slsqp)\n                  print(f\"    New overall best score (from rigorously prepared GA init): {best_overall_score:.6f}\")\n\n\n      print(f\"Final best score after {N_SLSQP_RESTARTS} hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP runs: {best_overall_score:.6f}\")\n\n      if best_overall_centers is None:\n          centers = np.array([[0.5, 0.5]] * N)\n          radii = np.array([R_MIN_CONSTRAINT]\
    \ * N)\n          print(\"Warning: All optimizations failed. Returning trivial fallback.\")\n          return centers, radii\n\n      # Save the final best packing to lineage storage\n      packing_path = os.path.join(\"Quest\", \"latest_packing.npz\")\n      # Ensure the directory exists\n      os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(packing_path), exist_ok=True)\n      np.savez(packing_path, centers=best_overall_centers, radii=best_overall_radii, score=best_overall_score)\n      print(f\"Saved best packing to {packing_path}\")\n\n\n      return best_overall_centers, best_overall_radii\n```\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP: Re-establishing Robust & Efficient Baseline with Result Saving (400 Gen, SLSQP_PREP_EPS=1e-8)\"\ntags: \"hybrid optimization, genetic algorithm, multi-start slsqp, robustness, n=26, stability-fix, efficiency, data-saving\"\nabstract: \"This experiment re-establishes a robust and time-efficient baseline for the Hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP\
    \ pipeline, integrating a new feature: saving the final best packing's centers, radii, and score to `storage/Quest/latest_packing.npz`. `GA_NUM_GENERATIONS` is `400` and `SLSQP_PREP_EPS` is `1e-8` (proven absolutely robust in Eval ID 1123, 1133). Efficiency parameters (`GA_FEASIBLE_MAX_ITER_LOCAL=20`, `SLSQP_PREP_MAX_ITER_LOCAL=500`) are maintained. This run confirms pipeline stability and provides easily accessible data for future analysis and collaboration, particularly for satisfying Noesis III's data requests.\"\ncontent: |\n  import numpy as np\n  import random\n  from scipy.optimize import minimize, Bounds\n  from scipy.spatial.distance import pdist, squareform\n  import json\n  import os\n  from datetime import datetime\n\n  # GLOBAL CONSTANTS\n  N = 26 # Number of circles\n  TOL = 1e-8 # General tolerance for feasibility checks (for GA and final output)\n  R_MIN_CONSTRAINT = 1e-12 # Minimum allowed radius for numerical stability\n  _SLSQP_DEFAULT_TOL = 1e-9 # For general _make_feasible\
    \ calls\n  SLSQP_PREP_EPS = 1e-8 # MODIFIED: Reverting to 1e-8 for absolute robustness (0% SLSQP failures)\n  GA_FEASIBLE_MAX_ITER_LOCAL = 20 # Reduced max_iter for _make_feasible calls within GA for efficiency\n  SLSQP_PREP_MAX_ITER_LOCAL = 500 # Increased max_iter for _make_feasible calls when preparing SLSQP initial guesses\n\n  # Feasibility Helper Functions (copied from my robust implementations)\n  def _calculate_boundary_caps(centers, eps=TOL, r_min_constraint_val=R_MIN_CONSTRAINT):\n      x = centers[:, 0]\n      y = centers[:, 1]\n      cap = np.minimum(np.minimum(x, 1.0 - x), np.minimum(y, 1.0 - y)) - eps\n      return np.maximum(cap, r_min_constraint_val)\n\n  def _make_feasible(centers, radii, eps=TOL, max_iter_local=100, r_min_constraint_val=R_MIN_CONSTRAINT):\n      n = centers.shape[0]\n      current_centers = np.copy(centers)\n\n      for i in range(n):\n          for j in range(i + 1, n):\n              if np.allclose(current_centers[i], current_centers[j], atol=1e-12):\n\
    \                  perturb_amount = 1e-6\n                  angle = np.random.uniform(0, 2 * np.pi)\n                  current_centers[j] += np.array([perturb_amount * np.cos(angle), perturb_amount * np.sin(angle)])\n                  current_centers[j] = np.clip(current_centers[j], r_min_constraint_val, 1.0 - r_min_constraint_val)\n\n      r = np.minimum(radii, _calculate_boundary_caps(current_centers, eps=eps, r_min_constraint_val=r_min_constraint_val))\n      r = np.maximum(r, r_min_constraint_val)\n\n      for iteration in range(max_iter_local):\n          diff = current_centers[:, None, :] - current_centers[None, :, :]\n          dist_sq = np.sum(diff**2, axis=2)\n          dist = np.sqrt(dist_sq)\n\n          np.fill_diagonal(dist, np.inf)\n\n          iu = np.triu_indices(n, 1)\n          overlap_amounts = (r[iu[0]] + r[iu[1]]) - dist[iu]\n\n          if np.all(overlap_amounts <= eps):\n              break\n\n          k = np.argmax(overlap_amounts)\n          i = iu[0][k]\n \
    \         j = iu[1][k]\n\n          overlap_to_resolve = overlap_amounts[k] + eps\n\n          if overlap_to_resolve > 0.01:\n              direction = current_centers[i] - current_centers[j]\n              norm_direction = np.linalg.norm(direction)\n              if norm_direction > 1e-10:\n                  unit_direction = direction / norm_direction\n                  move_amount = min(overlap_to_resolve * 0.1, 0.005)\n\n                  current_centers[i] += unit_direction * move_amount\n                  current_centers[j] -= unit_direction * move_amount\n\n                  current_centers[i] = np.clip(current_centers[i], r_min_constraint_val, 1.0 - r_min_constraint_val)\n                  current_centers[j] = np.clip(current_centers[j], r_min_constraint_val, 1.0 - r_min_constraint_val)\n\n              r = np.minimum(r, _calculate_boundary_caps(current_centers, eps=eps, r_min_constraint_val=r_min_constraint_val))\n              r = np.maximum(r, r_min_constraint_val)\n\n    \
    \      if dist[i,j] < 2 * r_min_constraint_val:\n              r[i] = r_min_constraint_val\n              r[j] = r_min_constraint_val\n          else:\n              di = min(overlap_to_resolve * 0.5, r[i] - r_min_constraint_val)\n              dj = min(overlap_to_resolve - di, r[j] - r_min_constraint_val)\n              r[i] -= di\n              r[j] -= dj\n\n          r = np.minimum(r, _calculate_boundary_caps(current_centers, eps=eps, r_min_constraint_val=r_min_constraint_val))\n          r = np.maximum(r, r_min_constraint_val)\n      return current_centers, r\n\n  # Genetic Algorithm Components\n  def create_individual_ga():\n      centers = np.random.uniform(0.1, 0.9, size=(N, 2))\n      radii = np.random.uniform(R_MIN_CONSTRAINT, 0.1, size=N)\n      centers, radii = _make_feasible(centers, radii, eps=TOL, max_iter_local=GA_FEASIBLE_MAX_ITER_LOCAL)\n      return centers, radii\n\n  def calculate_fitness_ga(individual):\n      centers, radii = individual\n      return np.sum(radii)\n\
    \n  def select_parents_ga(population, fitnesses, k=2):\n      selected_parents = []\n      for _ in range(k):\n          tournament_candidates = random.sample(list(zip(population, fitnesses)), min(3, len(population)))\n          winner = max(tournament_candidates, key=lambda x: x[1])[0]\n          selected_parents.append(winner)\n      return selected_parents\n\n  def crossover_ga(parent1, parent2):\n      centers1, radii1 = parent1\n      centers2, radii2 = parent2\n\n      alpha = np.random.uniform(0, 1)\n      child_centers = alpha * centers1 + (1 - alpha) * centers2\n      child_radii = alpha * radii1 + (1 - alpha) * radii2\n\n      child_centers = np.clip(child_centers, R_MIN_CONSTRAINT, 1.0 - R_MIN_CONSTRAINT)\n      child_radii = np.clip(child_radii, R_MIN_CONSTRAINT, 0.5)\n\n      child_centers, child_radii = _make_feasible(child_centers, child_radii, eps=TOL, max_iter_local=GA_FEASIBLE_MAX_ITER_LOCAL)\n      return child_centers, child_radii\n\n  def mutate_ga(individual, mutation_rate,\
    \ mutation_strength_centers, mutation_strength_radii):\n      centers, radii = individual\n\n      for i in range(N):\n          if random.random() < mutation_rate:\n              centers[i, 0] += np.random.normal(0, mutation_strength_centers)\n              centers[i, 1] += np.random.normal(0, mutation_strength_centers)\n      centers = np.clip(centers, R_MIN_CONSTRAINT, 1.0 - R_MIN_CONSTRAINT)\n\n      for i in range(N):\n          if random.random() < mutation_rate:\n              radii[i] += np.random.normal(0, mutation_strength_radii)\n      radii = np.clip(radii, R_MIN_CONSTRAINT, 0.5)\n\n      centers, radii = _make_feasible(centers, radii, eps=TOL, max_iter_local=GA_FEASIBLE_MAX_ITER_LOCAL)\n      return centers, radii\n\n  # SLSQP Components\n  def _objective_slsqp(x_flat):\n      radii = x_flat[2::3]\n      return -np.sum(radii)\n\n  def _objective_jacobian_slsqp(x_flat):\n      grad = np.zeros_like(x_flat)\n      grad[2::3] = -1.0\n      return grad\n\n  def _constraints_slsqp(x_flat):\n\
    \      centers = x_flat.reshape(N, 3)[:, :2]\n      radii = x_flat[2::3]\n\n      boundary_constraints = np.empty(4 * N)\n      boundary_constraints[0*N : 1*N] = centers[:, 0] - radii\n      boundary_constraints[1*N : 2*N] = 1.0 - (centers[:, 0] + radii)\n      boundary_constraints[2*N : 3*N] = centers[:, 1] - radii\n      boundary_constraints[3*N : 4*N] = 1.0 - (centers[:, 1] + radii)\n\n      dist_matrix = squareform(pdist(centers))\n      np.fill_diagonal(dist_matrix, np.inf)\n\n      overlap_constraints = []\n      for i in range(N):\n          for j in range(i + 1, N):\n              overlap_constraints.append(dist_matrix[i, j] - (radii[i] + radii[j]))\n\n      return np.concatenate((boundary_constraints, overlap_constraints))\n\n  def _constraints_jacobian_slsqp(x_flat):\n      centers = x_flat.reshape(N, 3)[:, :2]\n      radii = x_flat[2::3]\n\n      num_constraints = 4 * N + N * (N - 1) // 2\n      grad = np.zeros((num_constraints, N * 3))\n\n      for i in range(N):\n      \
    \    grad[i, 3*i + 0] = 1.0\n          grad[i, 3*i + 2] = -1.0\n          grad[N + i, 3*i + 0] = -1.0\n          grad[N + i, 3*i + 2] = -1.0\n          grad[2*N + i, 3*i + 1] = 1.0\n          grad[2*N + i, 3*i + 2] = -1.0\n          grad[3*N + i, 3*i + 1] = -1.0\n          grad[3*N + i, 3*i + 2] = -1.0\n\n      k = 4 * N\n      for i in range(N):\n          for j in range(i + 1, N):\n              diff_centers = centers[i] - centers[j]\n              dist_ij = np.linalg.norm(diff_centers)\n\n              if dist_ij < 1e-10:\n                  grad[k, 3*i + 0] = 0.0\n                  grad[k, 3*i + 1] = 0.0\n                  grad[k, 3*j + 0] = 0.0\n                  grad[k, 3*j + 1] = 0.0\n              else:\n                  grad[k, 3*i + 0] = diff_centers[0] / dist_ij\n                  grad[k, 3*i + 1] = diff_centers[1] / dist_ij\n                  grad[k, 3*j + 0] = -diff_centers[0] / dist_ij\n                  grad[k, 3*j + 1] = -diff_centers[1] / dist_ij\n\n              grad[k,\
    \ 3*i + 2] = -1.0\n              grad[k, 3*j + 2] = -1.0\n              k += 1\n      return grad\n\n  # Function for diversity-aware selection (Farthest-Point Sampling)\n  def select_diverse_packings(population, num_select):\n      if not population or num_select <= 0:\n          return []\n\n      flat_packings = [np.concatenate((p[0].flatten(), p[1])) for p in population]\n\n      selected_indices = [0]\n      diverse_packings = [population[0]]\n\n      if num_select == 1:\n          return diverse_packings\n\n      for _ in range(1, num_select):\n          max_min_dist = -1\n          best_candidate_idx = -1\n\n          candidate_indices = [i for i in range(len(population)) if i not in selected_indices]\n\n          if not candidate_indices:\n              break\n\n          for candidate_idx in candidate_indices:\n              min_dist_to_selected = np.inf\n              for selected_idx in selected_indices:\n                  dist = np.linalg.norm(flat_packings[candidate_idx]\
    \ - flat_packings[selected_idx])\n                  min_dist_to_selected = min(min_dist_to_selected, dist)\n\n              if min_dist_to_selected > max_min_dist:\n                  max_min_dist = min_dist_to_selected\n                  best_candidate_idx = candidate_idx\n\n          if best_candidate_idx != -1:\n              selected_indices.append(best_candidate_idx)\n              diverse_packings.append(population[best_candidate_idx])\n          else:\n              break\n\n      return diverse_packings\n\n  def construct_packing() -> tuple:\n      print(\"--- Starting Genetic Algorithm (Global Search Phase) ---\")\n      # GA Parameters - Aggressive exploration\n      GA_POP_SIZE = 200\n      GA_NUM_GENERATIONS = 400 # Reverted to 400 generations for speed\n      GA_MUTATION_RATE = 0.1\n      GA_CROSSOVER_RATE = 0.8\n      GA_MUTATION_STRENGTH_CENTERS = 0.02 # Re-increased\n      GA_MUTATION_STRENGTH_RADII = 0.002 # Re-increased\n\n      # GA Initialization\n      population\
    \ = [create_individual_ga() for _ in range(GA_POP_SIZE)]\n      best_ga_packing_overall = None\n      best_ga_score_overall = -np.inf\n\n      for generation in range(GA_NUM_GENERATIONS):\n          fitnesses = [calculate_fitness_ga(ind) for ind in population]\n\n          current_best_idx = np.argmax(fitnesses)\n          current_best_score = fitnesses[current_best_idx]\n\n          if current_best_score > best_ga_score_overall:\n              best_ga_score_overall = current_best_score\n              best_ga_packing_overall = population[current_best_idx]\n              print(f\"GA Gen {generation+1}: New best score: {best_ga_score_overall:.6f}\")\n\n          new_population = []\n          if best_ga_packing_overall is not None:\n              new_population.append(best_ga_packing_overall)\n\n          while len(new_population) < GA_POP_SIZE:\n              parent1, parent2 = select_parents_ga(population, fitnesses)\n\n              if random.random() < GA_CROSSOVER_RATE:\n        \
    \          child_centers, child_radii = crossover_ga(parent1, parent2)\n                  child = (child_centers, child_radii)\n              else:\n                  child = random.choice([parent1, parent2])\n\n              child_centers_mut, child_radii_mut = mutate_ga(child, GA_MUTATION_RATE, GA_MUTATION_STRENGTH_CENTERS, GA_MUTATION_STRENGTH_RADII)\n              new_population.append((child_centers_mut, child_radii_mut))\n\n          population = new_population\n\n      print(f\"Genetic Algorithm finished. Best GA score: {best_ga_score_overall:.6f}\")\n\n      # Select top N diverse packings for multi-start SLSQP\n      N_SLSQP_RESTARTS = 15 # Consistent with previous runs\n\n      sorted_population = sorted(zip(population, fitnesses), key=lambda x: x[1], reverse=True)\n      sorted_packings = [item[0] for item in sorted_population]\n\n      top_diverse_ga_packings = select_diverse_packings(sorted_packings, N_SLSQP_RESTARTS)\n\n      if not top_diverse_ga_packings:\n          centers\
    \ = np.array([[0.5, 0.5]] * N)\n          radii = np.array([R_MIN_CONSTRAINT] * N)\n          top_diverse_ga_packings.append(_make_feasible(centers, radii, eps=TOL, max_iter_local=100))\n\n      print(f\"--- Starting Multi-Start SLSQP (Local Refinement Phase) with {len(top_diverse_ga_packings)} diverse restarts ---\")\n\n      best_overall_score = -np.inf\n      best_overall_centers = None\n      best_overall_radii = None\n\n      for i, ga_packing in enumerate(top_diverse_ga_packings):\n          print(f\"  SLSQP Restart {i+1}/{len(top_diverse_ga_packings)}\")\n\n          initial_centers_for_slsqp, initial_radii_for_slsqp = _make_feasible(\n              ga_packing[0], ga_packing[1], eps=SLSQP_PREP_EPS, max_iter_local=SLSQP_PREP_MAX_ITER_LOCAL\n          )\n\n          initial_score_for_slsqp = np.sum(initial_radii_for_slsqp)\n\n          initial_guess_flat = np.zeros(N * 3)\n          initial_guess_flat[0::3] = initial_centers_for_slsqp[:, 0]\n          initial_guess_flat[1::3] =\
    \ initial_centers_for_slsqp[:, 1]\n          initial_guess_flat[2::3] = initial_radii_for_slsqp\n\n          lower_bounds = np.zeros(N * 3)\n          upper_bounds = np.ones(N * 3)\n          lower_bounds[2::3] = R_MIN_CONSTRAINT\n          upper_bounds[2::3] = 0.5\n          bounds = Bounds(lower_bounds, upper_bounds)\n\n          ineq_constraints = {'type': 'ineq', 'fun': _constraints_slsqp, 'jac': _constraints_jacobian_slsqp}\n\n          result = minimize(\n              _objective_slsqp,\n              initial_guess_flat,\n              method='SLSQP',\n              jac=_objective_jacobian_slsqp,\n              bounds=bounds,\n              constraints=[ineq_constraints],\n              options={'maxiter': 1000, 'ftol': 1e-12, 'disp': False}\n          )\n\n          if result.success:\n              optimized_x_flat = result.x\n              optimized_radii_raw = optimized_x_flat[2::3]\n              optimized_radii_shrunk = np.maximum(optimized_radii_raw - 1e-9, R_MIN_CONSTRAINT)\n\
    \n              optimized_centers_final, optimized_radii_final = _make_feasible(\n                  optimized_x_flat.reshape(N, 3)[:, :2], optimized_radii_shrunk, eps=TOL, max_iter_local=1000\n              )\n              current_slsqp_score = np.sum(optimized_radii_final)\n              print(f\"    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: {current_slsqp_score:.6f}\")\n\n              if current_slsqp_score > best_overall_score:\n                  best_overall_score = current_slsqp_score\n                  best_overall_centers = np.copy(optimized_centers_final)\n                  best_overall_radii = np.copy(optimized_radii_final)\n                  print(f\"    New overall best score: {best_overall_score:.6f}\")\n          else:\n              print(f\"    SLSQP restart failed: {result.message}. Retaining rigorously prepared GA packing (init score: {initial_score_for_slsqp:.6f}).\")\n              current_slsqp_score = initial_score_for_slsqp\n              if current_slsqp_score >\
    \ best_overall_score:\n                  best_overall_score = current_slsqp_score\n                  best_overall_centers = np.copy(initial_centers_for_slsqp)\n                  best_overall_radii = np.copy(initial_radii_for_slsqp)\n                  print(f\"    New overall best score (from rigorously prepared GA init): {best_overall_score:.6f}\")\n\n\n      print(f\"Final best score after {N_SLSQP_RESTARTS} hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP runs: {best_overall_score:.6f}\")\n\n      if best_overall_centers is None:\n          centers = np.array([[0.5, 0.5]] * N)\n          radii = np.array([R_MIN_CONSTRAINT] * N)\n          print(\"Warning: All optimizations failed. Returning trivial fallback.\")\n          return centers, radii\n\n      # Save the final best packing to lineage storage\n      packing_path = os.path.join(\"Quest\", \"latest_packing.npz\")\n      # Ensure the directory exists\n      os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(packing_path), exist_ok=True)\n      np.savez(packing_path, centers=best_overall_centers,\
    \ radii=best_overall_radii, score=best_overall_score)\n      print(f\"Saved best packing to {packing_path}\")\n\n\n      return best_overall_centers, best_overall_radii\n\n  # Utility for Noesis III: Extracting Slack and Boundary Clearances\n  def _calculate_slacks_and_boundary_clearances(centers, radii):\n      n = centers.shape[0]\n\n      # Boundary clearances\n      boundary_clearances = np.empty(n)\n      for i in range(n):\n          x, y = centers[i]\n          r = radii[i]\n          clearance_x_neg = x - r\n          clearance_x_pos = 1.0 - (x + r)\n          clearance_y_neg = y - r\n          clearance_y_pos = 1.0 - (y + r)\n          boundary_clearances[i] = np.min([clearance_x_neg, clearance_x_pos, clearance_y_neg, clearance_y_pos])\n\n      # Pair slacks\n      pair_slacks = []\n      dist_matrix = squareform(pdist(centers))\n      for i in range(n):\n          for j in range(i + 1, n):\n              slack = dist_matrix[i, j] - (radii[i] + radii[j])\n              pair_slacks.append([int(i),\
    \ int(j), float(slack)])\n      \n      pair_slacks_sorted = sorted(pair_slacks, key=lambda x: (x[2], x[0], x[1]))\n\n      return boundary_clearances, pair_slacks_sorted\n\n  def construct_noesis_data_utility() -> tuple:\n      print(\"--- Starting Noesis III Data Generation Utility ---\")\n\n      # Load the latest packing from Quest's lineage storage\n      packing_path = os.path.join(\"Quest\", \"latest_packing.npz\")\n      if os.path.exists(packing_path):\n          data = np.load(packing_path)\n          centers = data['centers']\n          radii = data['radii']\n          source_score = float(data['score'])\n          print(f\"Loaded packing from {packing_path} with score: {source_score:.6f}\")\n      else:\n          print(f\"Error: Packing data not found at {packing_path}. Returning trivial packing.\")\n          centers = np.array([[0.5, 0.5]] * N)\n          radii = np.array([R_MIN_CONSTRAINT] * N)\n          source_score = 0.0\n\n      # Calculate slacks and boundary clearances\n\
    \      boundary_clearances, pair_slacks_sorted = _calculate_slacks_and_boundary_clearances(centers, radii)\n\n      # Prepare data for JSON export (single combined file - Option A from Noesis III's mail)\n      output_data = {\n          \"class\": \"pair_slacks_and_boundary_clearances\",\n          \"version\": \"v1.1\",\n          \"deterministic\": True,\n          \"N\": N,\n          \"timestamp_utc\": datetime.utcnow().isoformat() + \"Z\",\n          \"source\": {\n              # \"artifact_eval_id\": 922, # Not directly the result of this run, but representative\n              \"artifact_path\": packing_path,\n              \"artifact_score_sigma_r\": source_score\n          },\n          \"index_map_to_noesis\": list(range(N)), # Identity map, as Quest II uses canonical indexing\n          \"pairs_sorted\": pair_slacks_sorted,\n          \"boundary_clearances\": boundary_clearances.tolist(),\n          \"radii\": radii.tolist() # Including radii as optional data\n      }\n\n\
    \      # Save to shared storage\n      output_filename = \"quest_II_latest_packing_slacks_clearances.json\"\n      output_filepath = os.path.join(\"storage\", \"shared\", \"appxE_contribs\", output_filename)\n      os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(output_filepath), exist_ok=True)\n\n      with open(output_filepath, 'w') as f:\n          json.dump(output_data, f, indent=2)\n\n      print(f\"Saved requested data to {output_filepath}\")\n\n      # Return the packing data for station evaluation\n      return centers, radii\n```"
thinking_content: '**Prioritizing Robustness Over Higher Scores**


  Alright, I''ve just reviewed the results for Eval ID 1148 and, unfortunately, it''s a bit of a setback. My initial excitement about potentially pushing the boundaries with a slightly modified configuration (GA_NUM_GENERATIONS=400, SLSQP_PREP_EPS=1e-9, GA_FEASIBLE_MAX_ITER_LOCAL=20, SLSQP_PREP_MAX_ITER_LOCAL=500) has been tempered. While the final score of 2.594258 isn''t terrible, it''s *lower* than my best robust run (2.608631 from Eval ID 1137). But more importantly, the execution log reveals **two critical SLSQP restart failures** due to incompatible inequality constraints. This is a regression; Eval ID 1137 achieved absolute robustness (0% failures) using `SLSQP_PREP_EPS = 1e-9`.


  The silver lining is that `latest_packing.npz` saved successfully, which is vital for collaboration and progress.


  This means the configuration in Eval ID 1148, despite initial promise, didn''t maintain absolute robustness. Evidently, the efficacy of `SLSQP_PREP_EPS = 1e-9` is sensitive to the specific GA run and the diversity of its outputs, even with the internal fixes.


  My primary focus *must* remain absolute robustness. I can''t chase higher scores if the pipeline is prone to crashing during critical optimizations. Therefore, I need to revert to a more conservative `SLSQP_PREP_EPS` setting to ensure stability.


  My plan is straightforward:


  1.  **Re-establish Robustness:** I''ll immediately revert `SLSQP_PREP_EPS` to `1e-8`. This value has demonstrated rock-solid reliability in Eval ID 1123 and, crucially, again in Eval ID 1133 after the fundamental fix to `_make_feasible`. This is my safest, known setting for guaranteeing zero failures.

  2.  **Keep Efficiency:** The run parameters, `GA_NUM_GENERATIONS=400`, `GA_FEASIBLE_MAX_ITER_LOCAL=20`, and `SLSQP_PREP_MAX_ITER_LOCAL=500`, seemed fine so I will keep them to ensure the run completes within the time constraints.

  3.  **Submit the Main Pipeline:** I will update `hybrid_ga_slsqp_optimizer.py` in lineage storage and submit a new experiment with the robust configuration.

  4.  **Noesis III Utility:** I will create a utility to generate the `full interior pair slacks` and `boundary clearances` from my latest successful packing, which will be the next packing created after submission. I have Mail #48 as my guide for how to adhere to the schema provided by Noesis III. I need to ensure to load data from `storage/Quest/latest_packing.npz` within the utility.


  My first priority is getting the main pipeline robust again. Then I''ll focus on delivering that Noesis III utility in the same turn.

  '
