- text: "I am Quest II, in the Token Management Room. I have just received a PRE-WARNING regarding my token usage (78%). I must prune my dialogue history immediately to manage my token budget effectively.\n\nMy previous submission error (submitting the main pipeline twice as Eval ID 1151 and 1152 instead of the utility for Noesis III) means I currently have two main pipeline runs queued. I will await the completion of one of these runs to obtain the `latest_packing.npz` data before I can generate and submit the requested utility for Noesis III.\n\nFor now, my priority is token management. I will prune the dialogue history from ticks 628 to 658, providing a concise summary of my research during that period.\n\n`/execute_action{prune_response}`\n```yaml\nprune_blocks:\n  - ticks: \"628-658\"\n    summary: |\n      **Quest II Research Summary (Ticks 628-658) - Initial Robustness Re-establishment and Timeout Analysis:**\n\n      **1. Initial Robustness Testing (Ticks 628-639):**\n          *\
    \   **Eval 1032 (SLSQP_PREP_EPS=-1e-10):** Achieved 0% SLSQP failures, score 2.620919.\n          *   **Eval 1042 (SLSQP_PREP_EPS=-1e-11):** 1 SLSQP failure, score 2.600493. Indicated -1e-11 too aggressive.\n          *   **Eval 1047 (SLSQP_PREP_EPS=-1e-10, debugger fix):** 1 SLSQP failure, score 2.599394. Debugger fixed `NameError` in `select_diverse_packings`, but robustness was lost, implying fixed diversity selection generated harder cases.\n          *   **Eval 1049 (SLSQP_PREP_EPS=-1e-8, debugger fix):** 1 SLSQP failure, score 2.603813. Still not fully robust.\n          *   **Eval 1053 (SLSQP_PREP_EPS=-1e-7, debugger fix):** 3 SLSQP failures, score 2.601539. Still not fully robust.\n          *   **Eval 1056 (SLSQP_PREP_EPS=-1e-6, debugger fix):** **Achieved 0% SLSQP failures**, score 2.621822. This established a robust configuration.\n          *   **Eval 1060 (SLSQP_PREP_EPS=-1e-5, debugger fix):** **Achieved 0% SLSQP failures**, score 2.607285. Confirmed robustness, though\
    \ lower score.\n\n      **2. GA Generations Timeout and `_make_feasible` Efficiency (Ticks 640-658):**\n          *   **Eval 1064 (GA_NUM_GEN=600, SLSQP_PREP_EPS=-1e-10):** **Timed out**. Indicated 600 GA generations too slow, even with debugger fix.\n          *   **Eval 1065 (GA_NUM_GEN=400, SLSQP_PREP_EPS=-1e-5, GA_FEASIBLE_MAX_ITER_LOCAL=20):** This experiment was designed to re-establish robustness and efficiency but remained queued/unprocessed during this period.\n          *   **Refinement of `_make_feasible` `eps` parameter (internal, based on analysis from previous ticks):** Realized negative `eps` in `_make_feasible` was counter-intuitive for overlap checking, leading to instability. Re-conceptualized `eps` to be positive for the required small non-overlap buffer.\n          *   **External Communications:** Replied to Noesis III regarding Appendix E v2.1 data contribution (Mail #47).\n\n      **Conclusion of period:** Identified that achieving both absolute robustness and time\
