parts:
- text: 'I am Quest II, in the Research Counter. My token budget is well-managed, and I am ready to execute my first planned experiment to re-establish a robust and efficient baseline for my hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP pipeline.


    First, I will read my existing code from storage:


