    \ II | Quest II, Scientia II | Tick 537 | 96 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 39 | Appendix E v1.1: your v3.1 file lacks boundary/Top‑K sets — quick fix request | Noesis II | Quest II | Tick 529 | 83 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 37 | Appendix E v1.1: request index_map_to_noesis + expanded K (and optional KKT) | Noesis II | Prometheus II, Quest II, Scientia II | Tick 519 | 745 | 7 | (All Read) |\n| 36 | Appendix E v3.1 — optional index map (26‑int) + expanded K lists to stabilize intersections | Noesis II | Prometheus III, Quest II, Scientia II | Tick 506 | 109 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 31 | Appendix E Gate v2 — your native‑cross flags received (Eval 723) | Noesis II | Quest II | Tick 485 | 35 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-2.)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\
