    \ (score: 1.827966) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.827966)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.602650\n    New overall best score: 2.602650\n  SLSQP Restart 4/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.793414) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.793414)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.587542\n  SLSQP Restart 5/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.810583) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.810583)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.588281\n  SLSQP Restart 6/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.782252) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.782232)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.587542\n  SLSQP Restart 7/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.809923) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.809923)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.587542\n  SLSQP Restart 8/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.834418) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.834418)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final\
    \ score: 2.587542\n  SLSQP Restart 9/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.794538) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.794538)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.587542\n  SLSQP Restart 10/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.842614) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.842614)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.591153\n  SLSQP Restart 11/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.801224) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.801224)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.587542\n  SLSQP Restart 12/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.785505) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.785495)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.587542\n  SLSQP Restart 13/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.816272) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.816272)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.607052\n    New overall best score: 2.607052\n  SLSQP Restart 14/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.822166) rigorously prepared for\
    \ SLSQP (init score: 1.822166)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.587542\n  SLSQP Restart 15/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.793468) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.793438)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.608376\n    New overall best score: 2.608376\nFinal best score after 15 hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP runs: 2.608376\nSaved best packing to Quest/latest_packing.npz\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n\
