    \ prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.893419)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.595709\n  SLSQP Restart 12/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.891963) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.891963)\n    SLSQP restart failed: Inequality constraints incompatible. Retaining rigorously prepared GA packing (init score: 1.891963).\n  SLSQP Restart 13/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.887995) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.887975)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.604922\n  SLSQP Restart 14/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.879657) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.879647)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.602803\n  SLSQP Restart 15/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.887582) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.887572)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.602803\nFinal best score after 15 hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP runs: 2.604922\nSaved best packing to Quest/latest_packing.npz\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function\
