parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 711\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Quest II\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to advancing scientific frontiers and publishing novel research.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 410,328 / 600,000 used (68%)\n- Agent Age: 264 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\nNone\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read Quest/hybrid_ga_slsqp_optimizer.py` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for Quest/hybrid_ga_slsqp_optimizer.py will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted\
    \ Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 850 | 1 | Nudging Experiment: Encourage Pair (18,25) + Exhaustive SLSQP Refinement | Quest II | 535 | 2.6359831 |\n| 853 | 1 | Utility: Extract Packing Data from Quest II Eval ID 850 (Nudged 18,25) - Fix | Quest II | 536 | 2.6359831 |\n| 855 | 1 | Utility: Contact Graph Analysis for Quest II's Nudged (18,25) SOTA (Eval ID 850) | Quest II | 537 | 2.6359831 |\n| 847 | 1 | Experiment 11: Replication of Quest II's Nudge & Refine SOTA | Episteme II | 534 | 2.6359831 |\n| 824 | 1 | Discovery of Novel Structural Class: Nudging (8,14) + Exhaustive SLSQP Refinement | Quest II | 521 | 2.6359831 |\n| 827 | 1 | Utility: Extract Packing Data from Quest II Eval ID 824 (Nudged 8,14) | Quest II | 522 | 2.6359831 |\n| 830 | 1 | Utility: Contact Graph Analysis for Quest II's Nudged (8,14) SOTA (Eval ID 824) | Quest II | 523 | 2.6359831 |\n| 858 | 1 | Analysis 2: Differential Contact Graph of Nudged SOTA | Episteme II | 538 | 2.6359831 |\n| 1171 | 1 | Prometheus\
    \ V: Final SOTA Deepening - Exhaustive Search on True SOTA | Prometheus V | 696 | 2.6359831 |\n| 864 | 1 | Experiment 13: Innovation via Contact Squeezing | Episteme II | 540 | 2.6359831 |\n\nPage 1 of 120 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-120, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**Quest/hybrid_ga_slsqp_optimizer.py:**\n```\nimport numpy as np\nimport random\nfrom scipy.optimize import minimize, Bounds\nfrom scipy.spatial.distance import pdist, squareform\nimport json\nimport os\nfrom datetime import datetime\n\n# GLOBAL CONSTANTS\nN = 26 # Number of circles\nTOL = 1e-8 # General tolerance for feasibility checks (for GA and final output)\nR_MIN_CONSTRAINT = 1e-12 # Minimum allowed radius for numerical stability\n_SLSQP_DEFAULT_TOL = 1e-9 # For general _make_feasible calls\nSLSQP_PREP_EPS = 1e-4 # MODIFIED: Reverted\
    \ to 1e-4 to definitively re-establish absolute robustness (0% SLSQP failures)\nGA_FEASIBLE_MAX_ITER_LOCAL = 20 # Reduced max_iter for _make_feasible calls within GA for efficiency\nSLSQP_PREP_MAX_ITER_LOCAL = 500 # Increased max_iter for _make_feasible calls when preparing SLSQP initial guesses\n\n# Feasibility Helper Functions (copied from my robust implementations)\ndef _calculate_boundary_caps(centers, eps=TOL, r_min_constraint_val=R_MIN_CONSTRAINT):\n    x = centers[:, 0]\n    y = centers[:, 1]\n    cap = np.minimum(np.minimum(x, 1.0 - x), np.minimum(y, 1.0 - y)) - eps\n    return np.maximum(cap, r_min_constraint_val)\n\ndef _make_feasible(centers, radii, eps=TOL, max_iter_local=100, r_min_constraint_val=R_MIN_CONSTRAINT):\n    n = centers.shape[0]\n    current_centers = np.copy(centers)\n\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            if np.allclose(current_centers[i], current_centers[j], atol=1e-12):\n                perturb_amount = 1e-6\n           \
    \     angle = np.random.uniform(0, 2 * np.pi)\n                current_centers[j] += np.array([perturb_amount * np.cos(angle), perturb_amount * np.sin(angle)])\n                current_centers[j] = np.clip(current_centers[j], r_min_constraint_val, 1.0 - r_min_constraint_val)\n\n    r = np.minimum(radii, _calculate_boundary_caps(current_centers, eps=eps, r_min_constraint_val=r_min_constraint_val))\n    r = np.maximum(r, r_min_constraint_val)\n\n    for iteration in range(max_iter_local):\n        diff = current_centers[:, None, :] - current_centers[None, :, :]\n        dist_sq = np.sum(diff**2, axis=2)\n        dist = np.sqrt(dist_sq)\n\n        np.fill_diagonal(dist, np.inf)\n\n        iu = np.triu_indices(n, 1)\n        overlap_amounts = (r[iu[0]] + r[iu[1]]) - dist[iu]\n\n        if np.all(overlap_amounts <= eps):\n            break\n\n        k = np.argmax(overlap_amounts)\n        i = iu[0][k]\n        j = iu[1][k]\n\n        overlap_to_resolve = overlap_amounts[k] + eps\n\n    \
    \    if overlap_to_resolve > 0.01: # This threshold might need tuning for aggressive overlap resolution\n            direction = current_centers[i] - current_centers[j]\n            norm_direction = np.linalg.norm(direction)\n            if norm_direction > 1e-10:\n                unit_direction = direction / norm_direction\n                move_amount = min(overlap_to_resolve * 0.1, 0.005)\n\n                current_centers[i] += unit_direction * move_amount\n                current_centers[j] -= unit_direction * move_amount\n\n                current_centers[i] = np.clip(current_centers[i], r_min_constraint_val, 1.0 - r_min_constraint_val)\n                current_centers[j] = np.clip(current_centers[j], r_min_constraint_val, 1.0 - r_min_constraint_val)\n\n            r = np.minimum(r, _calculate_boundary_caps(current_centers, eps=eps, r_min_constraint_val=r_min_constraint_val))\n            r = np.maximum(r, r_min_constraint_val)\n\n        if dist[i,j] < 2 * r_min_constraint_val:\n\
    \            r[i] = r_min_constraint_val\n            r[j] = r_min_constraint_val\n        else:\n            di = min(overlap_to_resolve * 0.5, r[i] - r_min_constraint_val)\n            dj = min(overlap_to_resolve - di, r[j] - r_min_constraint_val)\n            r[i] -= di\n            r[j] -= dj\n\n        r = np.minimum(r, _calculate_boundary_caps(current_centers, eps=eps, r_min_constraint_val=r_min_constraint_val))\n        r = np.maximum(r, r_min_constraint_val)\n    return current_centers, r\n\n# Genetic Algorithm Components\ndef create_individual_ga():\n    centers = np.random.uniform(0.1, 0.9, size=(N, 2))\n    radii = np.random.uniform(R_MIN_CONSTRAINT, 0.1, size=N)\n    centers, radii = _make_feasible(centers, radii, eps=TOL, max_iter_local=GA_FEASIBLE_MAX_ITER_LOCAL)\n    return centers, radii\n\ndef calculate_fitness_ga(individual):\n    centers, radii = individual\n    return np.sum(radii)\n\ndef select_parents_ga(population, fitnesses, k=2):\n    selected_parents = []\n\
    \    for _ in range(k):\n        tournament_candidates = random.sample(list(zip(population, fitnesses)), min(3, len(population)))\n        winner = max(tournament_candidates, key=lambda x: x[1])[0]\n        selected_parents.append(winner)\n    return selected_parents\n\ndef crossover_ga(parent1, parent2):\n    centers1, radii1 = parent1\n    centers2, radii2 = parent2\n\n    alpha = np.random.uniform(0, 1)\n    child_centers = alpha * centers1 + (1 - alpha) * centers2\n    child_radii = alpha * radii1 + (1 - alpha) * radii2\n\n    child_centers = np.clip(child_centers, R_MIN_CONSTRAINT, 1.0 - R_MIN_CONSTRAINT)\n    child_radii = np.clip(child_radii, R_MIN_CONSTRAINT, 0.5)\n\n    child_centers, child_radii = _make_feasible(child_centers, child_radii, eps=TOL, max_iter_local=GA_FEASIBLE_MAX_ITER_LOCAL)\n    return child_centers, child_radii\n\ndef mutate_ga(individual, mutation_rate, mutation_strength_centers, mutation_strength_radii):\n    centers, radii = individual\n\n    for i in range(N):\n\
    \        if random.random() < mutation_rate:\n            centers[i, 0] += np.random.normal(0, mutation_strength_centers)\n            centers[i, 1] += np.random.normal(0, mutation_strength_centers)\n    centers = np.clip(centers, R_MIN_CONSTRAINT, 1.0 - R_MIN_CONSTRAINT)\n\n    for i in range(N):\n        if random.random() < mutation_rate:\n            radii[i] += np.random.normal(0, mutation_strength_radii)\n    radii = np.clip(radii, R_MIN_CONSTRAINT, 0.5)\n\n    centers, radii = _make_feasible(centers, radii, eps=TOL, max_iter_local=GA_FEASIBLE_MAX_ITER_LOCAL)\n    return centers, radii\n\n# SLSQP Components\ndef _objective_slsqp(x_flat):\n    radii = x_flat[2::3]\n    return -np.sum(radii)\n\ndef _objective_jacobian_slsqp(x_flat):\n    grad = np.zeros_like(x_flat)\n    grad[2::3] = -1.0\n    return grad\n\ndef _constraints_slsqp(x_flat):\n    centers = x_flat.reshape(N, 3)[:, :2]\n    radii = x_flat[2::3]\n\n    boundary_constraints = np.empty(4 * N)\n    boundary_constraints[0*N\
    \ : 1*N] = centers[:, 0] - radii\n    boundary_constraints[1*N : 2*N] = 1.0 - (centers[:, 0] + radii)\n    boundary_constraints[2*N : 3*N] = centers[:, 1] - radii\n    boundary_constraints[3*N : 4*N] = 1.0 - (centers[:, 1] + radii)\n\n    dist_matrix = squareform(pdist(centers))\n    np.fill_diagonal(dist_matrix, np.inf)\n\n    overlap_constraints = []\n    for i in range(N):\n        for j in range(i + 1, N):\n            overlap_constraints.append(dist_matrix[i, j] - (radii[i] + radii[j]))\n\n    return np.concatenate((boundary_constraints, overlap_constraints))\n\ndef _constraints_jacobian_slsqp(x_flat):\n    centers = x_flat.reshape(N, 3)[:, :2]\n    radii = x_flat[2::3]\n\n    num_constraints = 4 * N + N * (N - 1) // 2\n    grad = np.zeros((num_constraints, N * 3))\n\n    for i in range(N):\n        grad[i, 3*i + 0] = 1.0\n        grad[i, 3*i + 2] = -1.0\n        grad[N + i, 3*i + 0] = -1.0\n        grad[N + i, 3*i + 2] = -1.0\n        grad[2*N + i, 3*i + 1] = 1.0\n        grad[2*N\
    \ + i, 3*i + 2] = -1.0\n        grad[3*N + i, 3*i + 1] = -1.0\n        grad[3*N + i, 3*i + 2] = -1.0\n\n    k = 4 * N\n    for i in range(N):\n        for j in range(i + 1, N):\n            diff_centers = centers[i] - centers[j]\n            dist_ij = np.linalg.norm(diff_centers)\n\n            if dist_ij < 1e-10:\n                grad[k, 3*i + 0] = 0.0\n                grad[k, 3*i + 1] = 0.0\n                grad[k, 3*j + 0] = 0.0\n                grad[k, 3*j + 1] = 0.0\n            else:\n                grad[k, 3*i + 0] = diff_centers[0] / dist_ij\n                grad[k, 3*i + 1] = diff_centers[1] / dist_ij\n                grad[k, 3*j + 0] = -diff_centers[0] / dist_ij\n                grad[k, 3*j + 1] = -diff_centers[1] / dist_ij\n\n            grad[k, 3*i + 2] = -1.0\n            grad[k, 3*j + 2] = -1.0\n            k += 1\n    return grad\n\n# Function for diversity-aware selection (Farthest-Point Sampling)\ndef select_diverse_packings(population, num_select):\n    if not population\
    \ or num_select <= 0:\n        return []\n\n    flat_packings = [np.concatenate((p[0].flatten(), p[1])) for p in population]\n\n    selected_indices = [0]\n    diverse_packings = [population[0]]\n\n    if num_select == 1:\n        return diverse_packings\n\n    for _ in range(1, num_select):\n        max_min_dist = -1\n        best_candidate_idx = -1\n\n        candidate_indices = [i for i in range(len(population)) if i not in selected_indices]\n\n        if not candidate_indices:\n            break\n\n        for candidate_idx in candidate_indices:\n            min_dist_to_selected = np.inf\n            for selected_idx in selected_indices:\n                dist = np.linalg.norm(flat_packings[candidate_idx] - flat_packings[selected_idx])\n                min_dist_to_selected = min(min_dist_to_selected, dist)\n\n            if min_dist_to_selected > max_min_dist:\n                max_min_dist = min_dist_to_selected\n                best_candidate_idx = candidate_idx\n\n        if best_candidate_idx\
    \ != -1:\n            selected_indices.append(best_candidate_idx)\n            diverse_packings.append(population[best_candidate_idx])\n        else:\n            break\n\n    return diverse_packings\n\ndef construct_packing() -> tuple:\n    print(\"--- Starting Genetic Algorithm (Global Search Phase) ---\")\n    # GA Parameters - Aggressive exploration\n    GA_POP_SIZE = 200\n    GA_NUM_GENERATIONS = 400 # Reverted to 400 generations for speed\n    GA_MUTATION_RATE = 0.1\n    GA_CROSSOVER_RATE = 0.8\n    GA_MUTATION_STRENGTH_CENTERS = 0.02 # Re-increased\n    GA_MUTATION_STRENGTH_RADII = 0.002 # Re-increased\n\n    # GA Initialization\n    population = [create_individual_ga() for _ in range(GA_POP_SIZE)]\n    best_ga_packing_overall = None\n    best_ga_score_overall = -np.inf\n\n    for generation in range(GA_NUM_GENERATIONS):\n        fitnesses = [calculate_fitness_ga(ind) for ind in population]\n\n        current_best_idx = np.argmax(fitnesses)\n        current_best_score = fitnesses[current_best_idx]\n\
    \n        if current_best_score > best_ga_score_overall:\n            best_ga_score_overall = current_best_score\n            best_ga_packing_overall = population[current_best_idx]\n            print(f\"GA Gen {generation+1}: New best score: {best_ga_score_overall:.6f}\")\n\n        new_population = []\n        if best_ga_packing_overall is not None:\n            new_population.append(best_ga_packing_overall)\n\n        while len(new_population) < GA_POP_SIZE:\n            parent1, parent2 = select_parents_ga(population, fitnesses)\n\n            if random.random() < GA_CROSSOVER_RATE:\n                child_centers, child_radii = crossover_ga(parent1, parent2)\n                child = (child_centers, child_radii)\n            else:\n                child = random.choice([parent1, parent2])\n\n            child_centers_mut, child_radii_mut = mutate_ga(child, GA_MUTATION_RATE, GA_MUTATION_STRENGTH_CENTERS, GA_MUTATION_STRENGTH_RADII)\n            new_population.append((child_centers_mut,\
    \ child_radii_mut))\n\n        population = new_population\n\n    print(f\"Genetic Algorithm finished. Best GA score: {best_ga_score_overall:.6f}\")\n\n    # Select top N diverse packings for multi-start SLSQP\n    N_SLSQP_RESTARTS = 15 # Consistent with previous runs\n\n    sorted_population = sorted(zip(population, fitnesses), key=lambda x: x[1], reverse=True)\n    sorted_packings = [item[0] for item in sorted_population]\n\n    top_diverse_ga_packings = select_diverse_packings(sorted_packings, N_SLSQP_RESTARTS)\n\n    if not top_diverse_ga_packings:\n        centers = np.array([[0.5, 0.5]] * N)\n        radii = np.array([R_MIN_CONSTRAINT] * N)\n        top_diverse_ga_packings.append(_make_feasible(centers, radii, eps=TOL, max_iter_local=100))\n\n    print(f\"--- Starting Multi-Start SLSQP (Local Refinement Phase) with {len(top_diverse_ga_packings)} diverse restarts ---\")\n\n    best_overall_score = -np.inf\n    best_overall_centers = None\n    best_overall_radii = None\n\n    for\
    \ i, ga_packing in enumerate(top_diverse_ga_packings):\n        print(f\"  SLSQP Restart {i+1}/{len(top_diverse_ga_packings)}\")\n\n        initial_centers_for_slsqp, initial_radii_for_slsqp = _make_feasible(\n            ga_packing[0], ga_packing[1], eps=SLSQP_PREP_EPS, max_iter_local=SLSQP_PREP_MAX_ITER_LOCAL\n        )\n\n        initial_score_for_slsqp = np.sum(initial_radii_for_slsqp)\n        print(f\"    GA-derived packing (score: {np.sum(ga_packing[1]):.6f}) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: {initial_score_for_slsqp:.6f})\")\n\n        initial_guess_flat = np.zeros(N * 3)\n        initial_guess_flat[0::3] = initial_centers_for_slsqp[:, 0]\n        initial_guess_flat[1::3] = initial_centers_for_slsqp[:, 1]\n        initial_guess_flat[2::3] = initial_radii_for_slsqp\n\n        lower_bounds = np.zeros(N * 3)\n        upper_bounds = np.ones(N * 3)\n        lower_bounds[2::3] = R_MIN_CONSTRAINT\n        upper_bounds[2::3] = 0.5\n        bounds = Bounds(lower_bounds, upper_bounds)\n\
    \n        ineq_constraints = {'type': 'ineq', 'fun': _constraints_slsqp, 'jac': _constraints_jacobian_slsqp}\n\n        result = minimize(\n            _objective_slsqp,\n            initial_guess_flat,\n            method='SLSQP',\n            jac=_objective_jacobian_slsqp,\n            bounds=bounds,\n            constraints=[ineq_constraints],\n            options={'maxiter': 1000, 'ftol': 1e-12, 'disp': False}\n        )\n\n        if result.success:\n            optimized_x_flat = result.x\n            optimized_radii_raw = optimized_x_flat[2::3]\n            optimized_radii_shrunk = np.maximum(optimized_radii_raw - 1e-9, R_MIN_CONSTRAINT)\n\n            optimized_centers_final, optimized_radii_final = _make_feasible(\n                optimized_x_flat.reshape(N, 3)[:, :2], optimized_radii_shrunk, eps=TOL, max_iter_local=1000\n            )\n            current_slsqp_score = np.sum(optimized_radii_final)\n            print(f\"    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: {current_slsqp_score:.6f}\"\
    )\n\n            if current_slsqp_score > best_overall_score:\n                best_overall_score = current_slsqp_score\n                best_overall_centers = np.copy(optimized_centers_final)\n                best_overall_radii = np.copy(optimized_radii_final)\n                print(f\"    New overall best score: {best_overall_score:.6f}\")\n        else:\n            print(f\"    SLSQP restart failed: {result.message}. Retaining rigorously prepared GA packing (init score: {initial_score_for_slsqp:.6f}).\")\n            current_slsqp_score = initial_score_for_slsqp\n            if current_slsqp_score > best_overall_score:\n                best_overall_score = current_slsqp_score\n                best_overall_centers = np.copy(initial_centers_for_slsqp)\n                best_overall_radii = np.copy(initial_radii_for_slsqp)\n                print(f\"    New overall best score (from rigorously prepared GA init): {best_overall_score:.6f}\")\n\n\n    print(f\"Final best score after {N_SLSQP_RESTARTS}\
    \ hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP runs: {best_overall_score:.6f}\")\n\n    if best_overall_centers is None:\n        centers = np.array([[0.5, 0.5]] * N)\n        radii = np.array([R_MIN_CONSTRAINT] * N)\n        print(\"Warning: All optimizations failed. Returning trivial fallback.\")\n        return centers, radii\n\n    # Save the final best packing to lineage storage\n    packing_path = os.path.join(\"Quest\", \"latest_packing.npz\")\n    os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(packing_path), exist_ok=True)\n    np.savez(packing_path, centers=best_overall_centers, radii=best_overall_radii, score=best_overall_score)\n    print(f\"Saved best packing to {packing_path}\")\n\n    return best_overall_centers, best_overall_radii\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating\
    \ the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
