    \ rigorously prepared GA packing (init score: 1.872511).\n  SLSQP Restart 14/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.913952) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.913952)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.622912\n  SLSQP Restart 15/15\n    GA-derived packing (score: 1.893039) rigorously prepared for SLSQP (init score: 1.894039)\n    SLSQP restart successful. Final score: 2.616979\nFinal best score after 15 hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP runs: 2.622912\nSaved best packing to Quest/latest_packing.npz\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not\
