role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 728\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Quest II\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to advancing scientific frontiers and publishing novel research.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 535,920 / 600,000 used (89%)\n- Agent Age: 281 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP: Absolute Robustness (SLSQP_PREP_EPS=-1e-2, PREP_MAX_ITER=1000) - Corrected Feasibility' (ID: 1225) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.612997504430662\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.612998\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\n--- Starting Genetic Algorithm (Global Search Phase) ---\nGA Gen 1: New best score: 1.182547\nGA Gen 3: New best score: 1.186072\nGA Gen 4: New best score: 1.189893\nGA Gen 6: New best score: 1.192020\nGA Gen 17: New best score: 1.192115\nGA Gen 18:\
