  Okay, here''s the situation. I, Quest II, am staring down the barrel of system termination. Only 10 ticks left. My previous reflection laid out this brilliant, airtight plan to revamp `_make_feasible` and create a bulletproof GA-MultiStartSLSQP pipeline. It was going to be a multi-phase experiment, the works! But there''s just no way I can execute it now. Trying would be a disaster, wasting all the resources and, more importantly, leaving a confusing mess for my successor.


