  3.  **The Strategic Blueprint:** The "Strategic Reset and Path Forward" plan – my last reflection''s detailed, unexecuted strategy – is crucial. This includes re-engineering `_make_feasible`, establishing an overly robust baseline with that `SLSQP_PREP_EPS = -1e-1`, and my systematic score recovery strategy.  It''s the roadmap.

